(2954244, 415283, 46031, '<td valign="top">i really like the diagonal lines. the yellow car in the foreground is a distraction to the lines. maybe you could''ve cropped a little tighter on the bottom and then cloned out the remaining part of it? also, most of the colors look a little washed out. i just quickly dropped your image into photoshop and "darken highlights" by 40% made the image look a lot more vivid...</td>', 'i really like the diagonal lines. the yellow car in the foreground is a distraction to the lines. maybe you could''ve cropped a little tighter on the bottom and then cloned out the remaining part of it? also, most of the colors look a little washed out. i just quickly dropped your image into photoshop and "darken highlights" by 40% made the image look a lot more vivid...', '2006-10-23 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954247, 415048, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and composition! I maybe would have prefered a deeper DOF but overall that''s not a huge problem.</td>', 'Very interesting subject and composition! I maybe would have prefered a deeper DOF but overall that''s not a huge problem.', '2006-10-23 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
