(2954940, 414422, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting but I don''t see how it has much to do with trains or railroads.  The tracks are being used as a prop, not the subject.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s interesting but I don''t see how it has much to do with trains or railroads.  The tracks are being used as a prop, not the subject.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-23 16:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
