(2955257, 414027, 66193, '<td valign="top">i really like the panning effect.  At least I hope that was the result of panning and not photshopped.  Please tell me it''s panning.</td>', 'i really like the panning effect.  At least I hope that was the result of panning and not photshopped.  Please tell me it''s panning.', '2006-10-23 18:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955258, 415458, 66193, '<td valign="top">love the colors and perspective of this one.</td>', 'love the colors and perspective of this one.', '2006-10-23 18:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955260, 415186, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photograph.  The subject, perspective, and processing all create a very nice antique sense to support the theme of the image.  The billowing black smoke really creates a sense of volume and movement in the scene also.  As a big fan of railroad images, I really love this one.  I can smell the environment and feel the rumble in the scene.  I love the smell of a coal-fired locomotive :)</td>', 'I like the feel of this photograph.  The subject, perspective, and processing all create a very nice antique sense to support the theme of the image.  The billowing black smoke really creates a sense of volume and movement in the scene also.  As a big fan of railroad images, I really love this one.  I can smell the environment and feel the rumble in the scene.  I love the smell of a coal-fired locomotive :)', '2006-10-23 18:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955262, 415243, 66193, '<td valign="top">i love the high contrast and sharp treatment.  I think you composed very well also.</td>', 'i love the high contrast and sharp treatment.  I think you composed very well also.', '2006-10-23 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955264, 415321, 66193, '<td valign="top">excellent!  could be a postcard.</td>', 'excellent!  could be a postcard.', '2006-10-23 18:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955265, 415436, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective on this one.</td>', 'very nice perspective on this one.', '2006-10-23 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955266, 415658, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice colors and the almost-centered placement of the tracks works here.</td>', 'very nice colors and the almost-centered placement of the tracks works here.', '2006-10-23 18:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955267, 415588, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little too dark, but well composed</td>', 'a little too dark, but well composed', '2006-10-23 18:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955277, 414423, 50674, '<td valign="top">the focus is oddly placed - the viewers attention is on the center because of the movement but the focus there on the left<br/>the idea is good though, very good</td>', 'the focus is oddly placed - the viewers attention is on the center because of the movement but the focus there on the leftthe idea is good though, very good', '2006-10-23 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
