(2955306, 415611, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo brings back memories for me... I used to spend a week each summer with my grandfather in South Carolina.  One of the highlights of my week was walking along the railroad tracks that ran behind his home.  Very nice work :)</td>', 'This photo brings back memories for me... I used to spend a week each summer with my grandfather in South Carolina.  One of the highlights of my week was walking along the railroad tracks that ran behind his home.  Very nice work :)', '2006-10-23 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
