(2955414, 415650, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photo, so much to look at, very interesting. I love the landscape, the plumes of smoke/steam and all those people have me intrigued! What are they doing in the middle of the field?</td>', 'What a wonderful photo, so much to look at, very interesting. I love the landscape, the plumes of smoke/steam and all those people have me intrigued! What are they doing in the middle of the field?', '2006-10-23 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
