(2955424, 414590, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the small scale of the engine next to the full size cars, but I think the composition could be a bit better - maybe a view from the ground up with the toy more prominant in the frame.  Alternately, some burning of the background to put more emphasis on the toy train might work.</td>', 'I like the idea and the small scale of the engine next to the full size cars, but I think the composition could be a bit better - maybe a view from the ground up with the toy more prominant in the frame.  Alternately, some burning of the background to put more emphasis on the toy train might work.', '2006-10-23 19:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955442, 415665, 19944, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the sharpness of the tracks, but the blur of the sky and trees just strikes me as odd.  Especially the blur on the bush on the left.  Parts of the bush seem sharp and others blurred.  I dunno, maybe it''s just me....</td>', 'I love the colors and the sharpness of the tracks, but the blur of the sky and trees just strikes me as odd.  Especially the blur on the bush on the left.  Parts of the bush seem sharp and others blurred.  I dunno, maybe it''s just me....', '2006-10-23 19:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955444, 415537, 19944, '<td valign="top">This shot, I''m really liking.  The black &amp; white is perfect.  It give the photo an almost desperate feel.  Like the guy with guitar is always moving from town to town.  Your photo speaks to me.  Well done.</td>', 'This shot, I''m really liking.  The black & white is perfect.  It give the photo an almost desperate feel.  Like the guy with guitar is always moving from town to town.  Your photo speaks to me.  Well done.', '2006-10-23 19:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
