(2955538, 414673, 64795, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about the title, unless you absolutely love the railroad.  Too bad background info. can''t be included.  Nice angle.</td>', 'I''m not so sure about the title, unless you absolutely love the railroad.  Too bad background info. can''t be included.  Nice angle.', '2006-10-23 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
