(2955546, 415670, 64795, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t really do it for me.  The glare on the car near the left side of the picture is a little distracting.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t really do it for me.  The glare on the car near the left side of the picture is a little distracting.', '2006-10-23 20:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
