(2955552, 415649, 64795, '<td valign="top">I know it''s moving but I''m not a big fan for blurred action.  I think the yellow building is a little bit distracting.</td>', 'I know it''s moving but I''m not a big fan for blurred action.  I think the yellow building is a little bit distracting.', '2006-10-23 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
