(2955560, 414591, 64795, '<td valign="top">Nice PP.  I love how you used the bridge(or whatever it is) to block out certain elements and accentuate others.</td>', 'Nice PP.  I love how you used the bridge(or whatever it is) to block out certain elements and accentuate others.', '2006-10-23 20:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
