(2955723, 414423, 29797, '<td valign="top">Holy cabooses!!! This is actually kind of scary! I can actually see the heat dissipation from the wheel bending the air around it like a hot desert mirage, at least I think that''s what it is. Glad to hear the camera made it through, and you obviously did as well. Maybe you should stick to less <i>dangerous</i> subjects for a while, like flowers and butterflies. :-) This is one VERY interesting perspective in this challenge, and I''ve been staring at it in disbelief on how you did this.</td>', 'Holy cabooses!!! This is actually kind of scary! I can actually see the heat dissipation from the wheel bending the air around it like a hot desert mirage, at least I think that''s what it is. Glad to hear the camera made it through, and you obviously did as well. Maybe you should stick to less dangerous subjects for a while, like flowers and butterflies. :-) This is one VERY interesting perspective in this challenge, and I''ve been staring at it in disbelief on how you did this.', '2006-10-23 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
