(2956330, 415520, 59740, '<td valign="top">It looks impressive but the actual size is quesswork unless there is a person or some other reference point.</td>', 'It looks impressive but the actual size is quesswork unless there is a person or some other reference point.', '2006-10-24 00:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
