(2956389, 415481, 36956, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good crop, I enjoy how the tracks don''t leave the frame, but fade in the distance.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good crop, I enjoy how the tracks don''t leave the frame, but fade in the distance.  One of my favorites.', '2006-10-24 01:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
