(2956503, 415523, 50034, '<td valign="top">"Rollin''...Rollin''...Rollin'' on the railroad!</td>', '"Rollin''...Rollin''...Rollin'' on the railroad!', '2006-10-24 01:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956506, 415481, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF!</td>', 'Nice DOF!', '2006-10-24 01:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956509, 415527, 50034, '<td valign="top">Aw, Cold Steel meets Cold Shoulder!  ;)</td>', 'Aw, Cold Steel meets Cold Shoulder!  ;)', '2006-10-24 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956518, 414870, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. The composition works. The concept is clear. I like the lens flares at left, by the man, they help deliver the idea of the image, I feel. However, the flares to the lower right I think are detrimental to the shot.</td>', 'An interesting shot. The composition works. The concept is clear. I like the lens flares at left, by the man, they help deliver the idea of the image, I feel. However, the flares to the lower right I think are detrimental to the shot.', '2006-10-24 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956542, 415136, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good shot here. Very sound composition. Nice tonality in the image. It is very easy to come across as ''gimmicky'' when doing selective desat. But I think here, it serves a good purpose, and helps drive the photo''s idea, and it ''works''. Nice job.</td>', 'Good shot here. Very sound composition. Nice tonality in the image. It is very easy to come across as ''gimmicky'' when doing selective desat. But I think here, it serves a good purpose, and helps drive the photo''s idea, and it ''works''. Nice job.', '2006-10-24 01:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956547, 415563, 60183, '<td valign="top">I laughed</td>', 'I laughed', '2006-10-24 01:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956549, 414781, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. There are elements here that I like. Nice tones. The curved tracks. Placement of the train in the composition. The misty haze of the city in the background. But it just kind of seems to me overall, a bit too much to take all in. A tad busy, and I find my eye quickly wanders off the train, and just continues to wander and I find myself losing grasp of the shot as a whole. Definitely not a bad shot, but I just feel held back from really getting into it.</td>', 'Hmmm. There are elements here that I like. Nice tones. The curved tracks. Placement of the train in the composition. The misty haze of the city in the background. But it just kind of seems to me overall, a bit too much to take all in. A tad busy, and I find my eye quickly wanders off the train, and just continues to wander and I find myself losing grasp of the shot as a whole. Definitely not a bad shot, but I just feel held back from really getting into it.', '2006-10-24 02:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956562, 415481, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot! A classic concept, but fresh enough with the little twists to really ''grab you''. The composition is just dead solid strong! Great use of leading lines and repetition. Wonderful detail, great tones. And I absolutely loVE the dof you''ve used. Really makes the shot. This is great photography :-)</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot! A classic concept, but fresh enough with the little twists to really ''grab you''. The composition is just dead solid strong! Great use of leading lines and repetition. Wonderful detail, great tones. And I absolutely loVE the dof you''ve used. Really makes the shot. This is great photography :-)', '2006-10-24 02:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956564, 414307, 38648, '<td valign="top">The first picture I voted on was this one, and it is a 10 IMO.  Great shot and editing.</td>', 'The first picture I voted on was this one, and it is a 10 IMO.  Great shot and editing.', '2006-10-24 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956565, 415158, 38648, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful.  Great capture and editing - 10.</td>', 'Just beautiful.  Great capture and editing - 10.', '2006-10-24 02:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956567, 415587, 38648, '<td valign="top">great composition, color, and clarity.  10</td>', 'great composition, color, and clarity.  10', '2006-10-24 02:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956569, 415100, 19831, '<td valign="top">Kudos for being so daring with this bold, non ''mainstream'' image. Probably won''t appeal to everybody''s taste, but fwiw, I quite like it.</td>', 'Kudos for being so daring with this bold, non ''mainstream'' image. Probably won''t appeal to everybody''s taste, but fwiw, I quite like it.', '2006-10-24 02:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956571, 414291, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool image here. Good sound composition. The selective desat thing can tend to be real gimmicky sometimes, but a great choice  here, I feel. Really works well and for sure makes the shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool image here. Good sound composition. The selective desat thing can tend to be real gimmicky sometimes, but a great choice  here, I feel. Really works well and for sure makes the shot. Nice job.', '2006-10-24 02:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956575, 415048, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Quite interesting, going with an abstract approach here. A kinda quirky photo, but I like it. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool image. Quite interesting, going with an abstract approach here. A kinda quirky photo, but I like it. Nice job.', '2006-10-24 02:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956580, 415190, 7786, '<td valign="top">Good colors and composition but to much sharpness can be seen as a halo around the top of the mountains.</td>', 'Good colors and composition but to much sharpness can be seen as a halo around the top of the mountains.', '2006-10-24 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956581, 415436, 19831, '<td valign="top">Really cool image. Great lines. The colors really stand out amidst all that steel! Obviously, the pov really makes the shot, man. Just really cool. Great eye, great job, great shot. :-)</td>', 'Really cool image. Great lines. The colors really stand out amidst all that steel! Obviously, the pov really makes the shot, man. Just really cool. Great eye, great job, great shot. :-)', '2006-10-24 02:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956583, 415110, 19831, '<td valign="top">Really nice image here. Great dof. Very solid concept, and the title even ties it together nicely. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice image here. Great dof. Very solid concept, and the title even ties it together nicely. Good job.', '2006-10-24 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956588, 414204, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very good idea here. I think the image would be a lot stronger if the focal plane (since you''ve gone with the real narrow dof) did not fall between ties. To me it seems like the sharpest object is the rock at left middle of frame edge, and thus very strongly draws my eye right to it, and I''m pretty sure your shot is not about that rock? :-) I keep trying to focus on the tie and spike head to the upper right of the rock..but, bam!, my eye just goes right to the rock.</td>', 'A very good idea here. I think the image would be a lot stronger if the focal plane (since you''ve gone with the real narrow dof) did not fall between ties. To me it seems like the sharpest object is the rock at left middle of frame edge, and thus very strongly draws my eye right to it, and I''m pretty sure your shot is not about that rock? :-) I keep trying to focus on the tie and spike head to the upper right of the rock..but, bam!, my eye just goes right to the rock.', '2006-10-24 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2956596, 414676, 19831, '<td valign="top">Kind of an abstracty, yin-yang thing going on here. Interesting. Cool, I like it.</td>', 'Kind of an abstracty, yin-yang thing going on here. Interesting. Cool, I like it.', '2006-10-24 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
