(2957181, 415582, 50034, '<td valign="top">I say it should be Old #9.  It would be Old #10, except that the focus is a little too complex for my taste.  ;)</td>', 'I say it should be Old #9.  It would be Old #10, except that the focus is a little too complex for my taste.  ;)', '2006-10-24 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957184, 415485, 50034, '<td valign="top">Stately statement!  :)</td>', 'Stately statement!  :)', '2006-10-24 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957187, 414710, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice "aging" effect!</td>', 'Nice "aging" effect!', '2006-10-24 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957188, 415530, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice sepiatone!  :)</td>', 'Nice sepiatone!  :)', '2006-10-24 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957224, 414204, 14735, '<td valign="top">Too shallow a DOF IMO</td>', 'Too shallow a DOF IMO', '2006-10-24 11:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957226, 415198, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the moody feel of this with the dark sky in the background. Nice composition</td>', 'I like the moody feel of this with the dark sky in the background. Nice composition', '2006-10-24 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957228, 414677, 66456, '<td valign="top">Well done, like the lighting, perspective and dark foreground.  My tastes run towards less of a centered or balanced look though.</td>', 'Well done, like the lighting, perspective and dark foreground.  My tastes run towards less of a centered or balanced look though.', '2006-10-24 11:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957230, 415650, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like your take on this with the photo getting the train on the move away from you.  Yours is the only one like that in this challenge.  Hopefully it wasn''t a mistake (had to change the battery, etc...).  :D  It''s kind of cool the way the smoke forms a diagonal line across the image.  Then the distant tree line and hillside act as a stopper and bring you back to the train (at least for me).  Hey!  I just noticed at the distant tree line - a line of people?  I only discovered this because I was wondering how this would look cropped in a bit and I was about ready to give you kudos for NOT cropping it.  Now I see another reason why you didn''t.  Fun image to look at.  Hope it does well for you - good luck.</td>', 'I like your take on this with the photo getting the train on the move away from you.  Yours is the only one like that in this challenge.  Hopefully it wasn''t a mistake (had to change the battery, etc...).  :D  It''s kind of cool the way the smoke forms a diagonal line across the image.  Then the distant tree line and hillside act as a stopper and bring you back to the train (at least for me).  Hey!  I just noticed at the distant tree line - a line of people?  I only discovered this because I was wondering how this would look cropped in a bit and I was about ready to give you kudos for NOT cropping it.  Now I see another reason why you didn''t.  Fun image to look at.  Hope it does well for you - good luck.', '2006-10-24 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957231, 415109, 66456, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interest.  Like the vanishing yellow line next to the train.</td>', 'Nice colors and interest.  Like the vanishing yellow line next to the train.', '2006-10-24 11:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957232, 414781, 66456, '<td valign="top">Nice...like the layered feel of the city in the background.</td>', 'Nice...like the layered feel of the city in the background.', '2006-10-24 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957233, 414521, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful in it''s simplicity and the way the viewer is drawn into the image with the road leading into the woods.  Very nice job of processing.  I love the tones.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is wonderful in it''s simplicity and the way the viewer is drawn into the image with the road leading into the woods.  Very nice job of processing.  I love the tones.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957241, 415472, 66456, '<td valign="top">I like the sparkle.</td>', 'I like the sparkle.', '2006-10-24 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957245, 415665, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color, simple image.  Traditional leading lines.  I like what you''ve done here.  One thing I do find distracting is what appears to be selective use of gaussian blur on the trees in the background.  The bare patch of tree that is sharp (couple of areas, one left and one right bg) make it evident that some manipulation was going on.  Not that it''s not know in general, but when it jumps out at you, well...it''s distracting, that''s all.  With all of that said - I still like it overall.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice color, simple image.  Traditional leading lines.  I like what you''ve done here.  One thing I do find distracting is what appears to be selective use of gaussian blur on the trees in the background.  The bare patch of tree that is sharp (couple of areas, one left and one right bg) make it evident that some manipulation was going on.  Not that it''s not know in general, but when it jumps out at you, well...it''s distracting, that''s all.  With all of that said - I still like it overall.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957247, 415245, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle here.  The water tower in the background is a nice touch.  Good color and clarity.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice angle here.  The water tower in the background is a nice touch.  Good color and clarity.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957249, 415453, 30049, '<td valign="top">So far, this is my top pick in this challenge.  It''s unique, and fun to look at.  Great use of a fresh POV to add interest.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'So far, this is my top pick in this challenge.  It''s unique, and fun to look at.  Great use of a fresh POV to add interest.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957254, 415436, 41536, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry.</td>', 'I love the symmetry.', '2006-10-24 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957256, 415526, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view but other than "this is a train" I''m not sure what the image says.</td>', 'I like the angle of view but other than "this is a train" I''m not sure what the image says.', '2006-10-24 11:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957264, 415186, 41536, '<td valign="top">Where is this taken?  Very nice</td>', 'Where is this taken?  Very nice', '2006-10-24 11:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957275, 415520, 16488, '<td valign="top">Insteresting subject with a lot of gritty detail but, to me, it just looks like a museum piece. The angle of your shot shows the engine off well...but as I read the image I end up at the right side of the frame with the distraction of the caboose fighting for my attention. Perhaps a different time of day would have added drama/mood to this fascinating relic.</td>', 'Insteresting subject with a lot of gritty detail but, to me, it just looks like a museum piece. The angle of your shot shows the engine off well...but as I read the image I end up at the right side of the frame with the distraction of the caboose fighting for my attention. Perhaps a different time of day would have added drama/mood to this fascinating relic.', '2006-10-24 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957279, 415563, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s cute and humorous but as a challenge entry it has a few "distractions" that are pulling it down.  Some haloing around the wheels and the persons torso.  Miscellaneous items in the background (tree, building, lines, etc...) that take away from the subject.  The color of the sky looks a little strange.  All of this is JMO of course and others may see it quite differently.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s cute and humorous but as a challenge entry it has a few "distractions" that are pulling it down.  Some haloing around the wheels and the persons torso.  Miscellaneous items in the background (tree, building, lines, etc...) that take away from the subject.  The color of the sky looks a little strange.  All of this is JMO of course and others may see it quite differently.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957280, 414485, 47124, '<td valign="top">i love 300ZX''s. nice car</td>', 'i love 300ZX''s. nice car', '2006-10-24 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957287, 415327, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness of the highlights on the engine...gives it a surreal feeling. The smoke is a big plus but the non-descript sky brings it down. I wonder if the background elements were softened and muted into wispy shadows if your subject would carry the impact it deserves...</td>', 'I like the smoothness of the highlights on the engine...gives it a surreal feeling. The smoke is a big plus but the non-descript sky brings it down. I wonder if the background elements were softened and muted into wispy shadows if your subject would carry the impact it deserves...', '2006-10-24 11:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957293, 415183, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting find for a subject.</td>', 'Interesting find for a subject.', '2006-10-24 11:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957294, 415465, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at in a documentary, photojournalism approach, but a little thin on the artistic side IMO.  Hope you got the heck out of there after taking the photo.  Thought they were evacuating the area (based on the forum thread I read).  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting to look at in a documentary, photojournalism approach, but a little thin on the artistic side IMO.  Hope you got the heck out of there after taking the photo.  Thought they were evacuating the area (based on the forum thread I read).  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957302, 414177, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops?  Not quite blurry enough to be abstract, yet too blurry to be a photo of merit.</td>', 'Oops?  Not quite blurry enough to be abstract, yet too blurry to be a photo of merit.', '2006-10-24 11:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957303, 415097, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nothing emotive or compelling here for me. I feel your colors are disturbingly off...washed out with a yellow cast.</td>', 'Nothing emotive or compelling here for me. I feel your colors are disturbingly off...washed out with a yellow cast.', '2006-10-24 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957323, 415582, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve worked to begin to isolate the subject. I feel, however, that there''s too much going on in the image as a whole for me to know where to focus my attention. Several ideas yank my eyes around, the "7," the fire, the light on the cab, and then the lovely "S" curve of the pipes emerges...</td>', 'I like the way you''ve worked to begin to isolate the subject. I feel, however, that there''s too much going on in the image as a whole for me to know where to focus my attention. Several ideas yank my eyes around, the "7," the fire, the light on the cab, and then the lovely "S" curve of the pipes emerges...', '2006-10-24 11:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957325, 415412, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice way to isolate a concept. I like the grain of the image. The crop feels a little awkward, though...especially with the inclusion of the element in the upper right corner and the cut-off of the most foreground spike.</td>', 'Nice way to isolate a concept. I like the grain of the image. The crop feels a little awkward, though...especially with the inclusion of the element in the upper right corner and the cut-off of the most foreground spike.', '2006-10-24 11:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957332, 414404, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bummer about missing the Woody challenge...you''re going to get hammered a little for the use of a toy train I think, at least for this challenge.  JMO of course.<br/> <br/>About this image.  Couple of things jumping out at me.  1) The burn/blurring of the background or table material is quite evident and unnatural.  Would have been better off blurring the whole textured area, or if you were removing text or some graphics then do as you have but then blur the whole area afterwards.  2) What''s going on by the train on the tracks?  Looks grainy like some dodging was done and not healed?  <br/> <br/>The composition itself is fine with Woody well positioned in the frame, and the train track does a nice job with leading lines.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Bummer about missing the Woody challenge...you''re going to get hammered a little for the use of a toy train I think, at least for this challenge.  JMO of course. About this image.  Couple of things jumping out at me.  1) The burn/blurring of the background or table material is quite evident and unnatural.  Would have been better off blurring the whole textured area, or if you were removing text or some graphics then do as you have but then blur the whole area afterwards.  2) What''s going on by the train on the tracks?  Looks grainy like some dodging was done and not healed?   The composition itself is fine with Woody well positioned in the frame, and the train track does a nice job with leading lines.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957350, 415672, 30049, '<td valign="top">Maybe if the entire outline of the train "engine" was sharp this would have a better chance?  Or, if something had to be out of focal range then make sure the curved front area and "smokestack" are crisp.  What''s that blue glowing line in front?  The lighting is kind of neat overall.  Using a toy train kind of doomed you from the start.  :(  Good luck.</td>', 'Maybe if the entire outline of the train "engine" was sharp this would have a better chance?  Or, if something had to be out of focal range then make sure the curved front area and "smokestack" are crisp.  What''s that blue glowing line in front?  The lighting is kind of neat overall.  Using a toy train kind of doomed you from the start.  :(  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 11:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957356, 415175, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the sweep of the tracks and the way they lead to the interestingly shaped building...but the empty sky takes away so much.</td>', 'I like the sweep of the tracks and the way they lead to the interestingly shaped building...but the empty sky takes away so much.', '2006-10-24 11:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957360, 415167, 65779, '<td valign="top">This is a bit heavy-handed for my liking. It has an interesting feel but a bit over the top.</td>', 'This is a bit heavy-handed for my liking. It has an interesting feel but a bit over the top.', '2006-10-24 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957361, 414485, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why are you telling the viewers about "tracks in the background"?  Is it because the subject of your image is the car when the challenge theme is about trains &amp; railroads?  It''s not terrible or anything, just appears that you''ve made the tracks a secondary item or prop for this photo.  Nice job of blurring the background and controlling the reflections on the car.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why are you telling the viewers about "tracks in the background"?  Is it because the subject of your image is the car when the challenge theme is about trains & railroads?  It''s not terrible or anything, just appears that you''ve made the tracks a secondary item or prop for this photo.  Nice job of blurring the background and controlling the reflections on the car.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957363, 414643, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and mood of this image but the concept of "train" is lost in the long exposure...it could easily be just an elevated highway as anything else. In addtion, the size of your model in the frame seems to dwarf the the city creating, for me, an impression of looking at scale-model of a city. Sorry, maybe I just had to be there.</td>', 'I like the lighting and mood of this image but the concept of "train" is lost in the long exposure...it could easily be just an elevated highway as anything else. In addtion, the size of your model in the frame seems to dwarf the the city creating, for me, an impression of looking at scale-model of a city. Sorry, maybe I just had to be there.', '2006-10-24 11:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957367, 415244, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  The use of a toy train is probably going to hamper your score some.  That, and the image is quite grainy and a little flat.  Lighting could be stronger and why did you go B/W?  Color may have been a better choice all things considered.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Uh-oh.  The use of a toy train is probably going to hamper your score some.  That, and the image is quite grainy and a little flat.  Lighting could be stronger and why did you go B/W?  Color may have been a better choice all things considered.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957373, 415213, 65779, '<td valign="top">The isolated colour works well in this one. Well done.</td>', 'The isolated colour works well in this one. Well done.', '2006-10-24 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957379, 414783, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice concept to have the train framed by the tunnel...looks like it took some patience to capture the train in the right position.  The story is broken, however, by the realization that the tunnel is not the tunnel for the train...unless it''s running on rubber wheels. Image also appear washed out on my monitor...would like the blacks to be black.</td>', 'Nice concept to have the train framed by the tunnel...looks like it took some patience to capture the train in the right position.  The story is broken, however, by the realization that the tunnel is not the tunnel for the train...unless it''s running on rubber wheels. Image also appear washed out on my monitor...would like the blacks to be black.', '2006-10-24 11:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957380, 414204, 65779, '<td valign="top">DOF is just too shallow for me. It would be better if the next nail were in focus too.  Otherwise good compo.</td>', 'DOF is just too shallow for me. It would be better if the next nail were in focus too.  Otherwise good compo.', '2006-10-24 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957382, 415375, 16488, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t say "train track" to me. Perhaps it''s a trolley track? But there''s so little context to carry the idea in the image...no real point of interest once the rail is seen to keep me looking.</td>', 'This just doesn''t say "train track" to me. Perhaps it''s a trolley track? But there''s so little context to carry the idea in the image...no real point of interest once the rail is seen to keep me looking.', '2006-10-24 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957386, 415525, 65779, '<td valign="top">Classic train shot.  Very nice!</td>', 'Classic train shot.  Very nice!', '2006-10-24 12:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957387, 415658, 65779, '<td valign="top">Look how squiffy the tracks are! I like the texture of the gravel and rich colours.</td>', 'Look how squiffy the tracks are! I like the texture of the gravel and rich colours.', '2006-10-24 12:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957392, 415474, 65779, '<td valign="top">It would be clearer if you used rope to tie her.  At first I thought she was just parking off laughing.</td>', 'It would be clearer if you used rope to tie her.  At first I thought she was just parking off laughing.', '2006-10-24 12:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957398, 414307, 65779, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much. Good luck</td>', 'I like this shot very much. Good luck', '2006-10-24 12:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
