(2957414, 413517, 30049, '<td valign="top">Technically it works for the challenge.  May take people a minute to recognize it for what it is.  The image itself is also busy and the subject doesn''t get isolated enough for good identification/exposure - blends in with the surroundings.  That cool wall painting in the back left steals the show!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Technically it works for the challenge.  May take people a minute to recognize it for what it is.  The image itself is also busy and the subject doesn''t get isolated enough for good identification/exposure - blends in with the surroundings.  That cool wall painting in the back left steals the show!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 12:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957416, 415477, 64046, '<td valign="top">Great study.</td>', 'Great study.', '2006-10-24 12:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957419, 415277, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thanks to your title I had to hunt around and figure out what you were talking about.  :D  Kind of takes away from the core subject of the challenge theme IMO by directing viewers that way.  Good luck.</td>', 'Thanks to your title I had to hunt around and figure out what you were talking about.  :D  Kind of takes away from the core subject of the challenge theme IMO by directing viewers that way.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957423, 414521, 16488, '<td valign="top">Love the image. Hate the title.</td>', 'Love the image. Hate the title.', '2006-10-24 12:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957430, 415079, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen frost on trees like that.  Strange.  The sky is a weird gloomy color that matches the dirt road off to the bottom right.  Something just doesn''t feel right with this photo.  Sorry, wish I could say what.  I do think that the railroad tracks are minimized way too much for the theme of the challenge.  Seems like your image is more about the landscape.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve never seen frost on trees like that.  Strange.  The sky is a weird gloomy color that matches the dirt road off to the bottom right.  Something just doesn''t feel right with this photo.  Sorry, wish I could say what.  I do think that the railroad tracks are minimized way too much for the theme of the challenge.  Seems like your image is more about the landscape.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 12:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957442, 412886, 30049, '<td valign="top">Your title lends me to believe that you''re intentionally going for a vintage/sepia tone for this photo?  Overall it''s fine and the POV is good.  It could be this monitor, but it seems like you could boost the black just a little.  Probably could have cloned out the cars and building in the bottom left being that this is an advanced editing challenge.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your title lends me to believe that you''re intentionally going for a vintage/sepia tone for this photo?  Overall it''s fine and the POV is good.  It could be this monitor, but it seems like you could boost the black just a little.  Probably could have cloned out the cars and building in the bottom left being that this is an advanced editing challenge.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 12:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957457, 414834, 46031, '<td valign="top">very nice, it almost has an abstract feel to it, created by the high contrast and the lack of humans in the picture</td>', 'very nice, it almost has an abstract feel to it, created by the high contrast and the lack of humans in the picture', '2006-10-24 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957500, 415370, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white. Comp is nice and subject is interesting.</td>', 'I like the black and white. Comp is nice and subject is interesting.', '2006-10-24 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957504, 415520, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and background. Front of train seems a bit overblown.</td>', 'Nice subject and background. Front of train seems a bit overblown.', '2006-10-24 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957506, 413141, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture on this. NIce compa and interesting subject.</td>', 'Very nice texture on this. NIce compa and interesting subject.', '2006-10-24 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957508, 415186, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp and perspective! Focus seems a bit soft but an incredible capture.</td>', 'Great comp and perspective! Focus seems a bit soft but an incredible capture.', '2006-10-24 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957509, 415629, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great compa and perspective. I like how you captured a lot of the train.</td>', 'Great compa and perspective. I like how you captured a lot of the train.', '2006-10-24 13:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957512, 415519, 30049, '<td valign="top">The bridge really adds to this.  Keeps the viewer constrained some I think.  The "waver" is a cute touch.  Wonderful job of post-processing.  The tones are very nice and you''ve covered the range quick well.  Good luck.</td>', 'The bridge really adds to this.  Keeps the viewer constrained some I think.  The "waver" is a cute touch.  Wonderful job of post-processing.  The tones are very nice and you''ve covered the range quick well.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957513, 414307, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lot''s to look at here.  Maybe too much for some, but I like it.  Very nice job of getting the exposure correct for this setting - HDR maybe?   Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lot''s to look at here.  Maybe too much for some, but I like it.  Very nice job of getting the exposure correct for this setting - HDR maybe?   Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957516, 413351, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of DOF to isolate the spike and eliminate the background.  Sharp, well focused where it counts.   I do want to "push" the spike to the right some to balance this.  :D  Should do fine with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful use of DOF to isolate the spike and eliminate the background.  Sharp, well focused where it counts.   I do want to "push" the spike to the right some to balance this.  :D  Should do fine with this.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
