(2957621, 415658, 64795, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and title.</td>', 'Nice picture and title.', '2006-10-24 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957724, 414521, 47916, '<td valign="top">great shot, love the title!</td>', 'great shot, love the title!', '2006-10-24 14:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957948, 415525, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a railyard.  Captures the essence of what they are - not a pretty sight, but busy, hectic, and dirty.  I hope you do well with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot of a railyard.  Captures the essence of what they are - not a pretty sight, but busy, hectic, and dirty.  I hope you do well with this.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 16:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957951, 415145, 30049, '<td valign="top">The tone of the image is too warm for it to be "Cold" steel.  :D  Actually, I like the tone you took with your processing approach.  Nice tonal range.  Interesting to look at.  Can almost feel the power of that engine.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The tone of the image is too warm for it to be "Cold" steel.  :D  Actually, I like the tone you took with your processing approach.  Nice tonal range.  Interesting to look at.  Can almost feel the power of that engine.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957957, 415629, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun to see some of these in color, including people, and a real working train/railroad environment.  You''ve done a nice job putting this together.  The technicals are all in place.  The two figures give the viewer a nice focal point and keep the interest in the body of the image.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun to see some of these in color, including people, and a real working train/railroad environment.  You''ve done a nice job putting this together.  The technicals are all in place.  The two figures give the viewer a nice focal point and keep the interest in the body of the image.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957970, 414669, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice human touch.  I do get the feeling that this is a museum type setup, but that''s ok overall.  A little contrasty around the edges but it serves to bring the viewer to center (which is almost backwards - usually a frame or vignetting for that purpose is darker).  The placement of the guitar man adds as well by having a dark background behind him allowing him to stand out more.  Not sure if that was intentional, but it worked.  :D<br/> <br/>Normally I''m not a selective desat person, but it would be interesting to see what this looked like with the guitar isolated by it''s color.  ???<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice human touch.  I do get the feeling that this is a museum type setup, but that''s ok overall.  A little contrasty around the edges but it serves to bring the viewer to center (which is almost backwards - usually a frame or vignetting for that purpose is darker).  The placement of the guitar man adds as well by having a dark background behind him allowing him to stand out more.  Not sure if that was intentional, but it worked.  :D Normally I''m not a selective desat person, but it would be interesting to see what this looked like with the guitar isolated by it''s color.  ??? Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957981, 415481, 46031, '<td valign="top">absolutely great, colors, dof and sharpness are just right. the composition is awesome!</td>', 'absolutely great, colors, dof and sharpness are just right. the composition is awesome!', '2006-10-24 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957989, 415236, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a quaint little part of town.  Fun place to walk around some with camera in hand.  :D  The image is fine for the most part.  I do find my focus as a viewer split between the left and right sides of the track, then down the line.  Hard to find a comfortable place to rest and visit this image for awhile.  Honestly, there isn''t anything really jumping out saying "look at me", but it''s ok.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a quaint little part of town.  Fun place to walk around some with camera in hand.  :D  The image is fine for the most part.  I do find my focus as a viewer split between the left and right sides of the track, then down the line.  Hard to find a comfortable place to rest and visit this image for awhile.  Honestly, there isn''t anything really jumping out saying "look at me", but it''s ok.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957991, 415588, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful view, not a boring trip by train through such landscape..love the warm autumn colors you''ve managed to capture..</td>', 'What a beautiful view, not a boring trip by train through such landscape..love the warm autumn colors you''ve managed to capture..', '2006-10-24 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957994, 415520, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s big, and your POV helps bring that out some.  A little bit hard to get a real context for size by the surrounding objects.  I think the way you''ve processed it works well.  It''s sharp enough and well balanced compositionally.  Close to being overexposed...on the edge...actually, probably just about right.  :D  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yep, it''s big, and your POV helps bring that out some.  A little bit hard to get a real context for size by the surrounding objects.  I think the way you''ve processed it works well.  It''s sharp enough and well balanced compositionally.  Close to being overexposed...on the edge...actually, probably just about right.  :D  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958000, 415112, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Simple, clean, nice landscape.  Some color.  The engine looks like it could be a little sharper focus wise, but overall pretty good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice.  Simple, clean, nice landscape.  Some color.  The engine looks like it could be a little sharper focus wise, but overall pretty good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958005, 414281, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a polarizing image.  Meaning that some are going to really like it, and some aren''t - the processing that is.  I find it interesting, not overly fond of it, but don''t hate it either.  Sorry if that sounds like I''m on the fence with this one, because I am.  :D  Reminds me of another image I''ve seen on DPC some time ago of a bus.  Was it you?  Hmmm...have to check you out after the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a polarizing image.  Meaning that some are going to really like it, and some aren''t - the processing that is.  I find it interesting, not overly fond of it, but don''t hate it either.  Sorry if that sounds like I''m on the fence with this one, because I am.  :D  Reminds me of another image I''ve seen on DPC some time ago of a bus.  Was it you?  Hmmm...have to check you out after the challenge.  Good luck!', '2006-10-24 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958012, 413324, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s ok.  Almost would have been better coming in closer and losing one of the wheels.  Seems too balanced this way IMO.  The image is sharp and well focused with a nice job of processing applied.  The rust color comes off well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s ok.  Almost would have been better coming in closer and losing one of the wheels.  Seems too balanced this way IMO.  The image is sharp and well focused with a nice job of processing applied.  The rust color comes off well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958020, 415048, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  It''s an X.  :D  I can see where you were going with this and I like the way you''ve set it up (framing/composition).  With the shallower DOF I''m finding the soft focus makes it look even less focused, like the X itself isn''t crisp enough.  I have to look to the rocks on the side to find the true focal point.  Nice color and tones overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  It''s an X.  :D  I can see where you were going with this and I like the way you''ve set it up (framing/composition).  With the shallower DOF I''m finding the soft focus makes it look even less focused, like the X itself isn''t crisp enough.  I have to look to the rocks on the side to find the true focal point.  Nice color and tones overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958061, 415110, 164, '<td valign="top">Interesting vantage point</td>', 'Interesting vantage point', '2006-10-24 16:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958069, 415283, 164, '<td valign="top">drab colors</td>', 'drab colors', '2006-10-24 16:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958075, 415452, 30049, '<td valign="top">She''s a very attractive model and this is a nice photograph of her.  One minor problem - she is the subject of your image.  The theme for the challenge is trains &amp; railroads.  In this case the theme is secondary and being used as a prop alone.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'She''s a very attractive model and this is a nice photograph of her.  One minor problem - she is the subject of your image.  The theme for the challenge is trains & railroads.  In this case the theme is secondary and being used as a prop alone.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958084, 414869, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  It''s "ok".  I say that only because the subject itself is a little plain-jane.  Technically the image is fine overall, maybe a little underexposed.  I think there is abstract potential here with a different post-processing approach and color tone selections.  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  It''s "ok".  I say that only because the subject itself is a little plain-jane.  Technically the image is fine overall, maybe a little underexposed.  I think there is abstract potential here with a different post-processing approach and color tone selections.  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958094, 415220, 30049, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to find the train &amp; railroad part of this photograph.  I found it.  :D  I don''t know.  Something about it, just feels like it''s more about the winery sign than trains &amp; railroads.  It''s a well executed image as far as your technicals go (focus, exposure, etc...)  Composition is where it comes up a tad short for me.  Sorry.  JMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Took me a minute to find the train & railroad part of this photograph.  I found it.  :D  I don''t know.  Something about it, just feels like it''s more about the winery sign than trains & railroads.  It''s a well executed image as far as your technicals go (focus, exposure, etc...)  Composition is where it comes up a tad short for me.  Sorry.  JMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958099, 415198, 31443, '<td valign="top">Solemn and nostalgic mood, love the textures you''ve managed to bring out..</td>', 'Solemn and nostalgic mood, love the textures you''ve managed to bring out..', '2006-10-24 17:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958114, 415233, 37719, '<td valign="top">My original comment was really a place holder so I could find this faster when I return.  I really like the combination of lighting in the shot.  They are balanced very well - nice job!  it doesn''t really look like a train track - ending at the beach doesn''t make sense.  But the impression is certainly there.  The colors are developed and separated well in the sky and on the horizon.  Another aspect I like is the strip of silhouetted area in the middle.  Overall, nice exposure, interesting composition.</td>', 'My original comment was really a place holder so I could find this faster when I return.  I really like the combination of lighting in the shot.  They are balanced very well - nice job!  it doesn''t really look like a train track - ending at the beach doesn''t make sense.  But the impression is certainly there.  The colors are developed and separated well in the sky and on the horizon.  Another aspect I like is the strip of silhouetted area in the middle.  Overall, nice exposure, interesting composition.', '2006-10-24 17:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958120, 415471, 37719, '<td valign="top">My only criticism is the large white, bright sky area.  I find myself either drawn to it or looking lower than your intended subject to get away from it.</td>', 'My only criticism is the large white, bright sky area.  I find myself either drawn to it or looking lower than your intended subject to get away from it.', '2006-10-24 17:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958131, 415516, 37719, '<td valign="top">Excellent ''candid'' shot or ''street'' shot here.  The composition is very well done.  The details are crisp and clear.  The colors are well placed (red and blue) and present a nce balance to the grays and blacks.  They also help to keep you focused in your subject area.  Well done!</td>', 'Excellent ''candid'' shot or ''street'' shot here.  The composition is very well done.  The details are crisp and clear.  The colors are well placed (red and blue) and present a nce balance to the grays and blacks.  They also help to keep you focused in your subject area.  Well done!', '2006-10-24 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958211, 415436, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, perfect balance, looks like a super clean station.</td>', 'Nice perspective, perfect balance, looks like a super clean station.', '2006-10-24 17:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
