(2958323, 415190, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Terrific scenery!  Good shot.</td>', 'Wow!  Terrific scenery!  Good shot.', '2006-10-24 18:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958324, 414318, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good choice of POV - it makes this train look large and daunting.</td>', 'Good choice of POV - it makes this train look large and daunting.', '2006-10-24 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958331, 415193, 65858, '<td valign="top">This is going to score low because of the harsh JPEG compression visible: in the blue of the ice, there are blocky JPEG artifacts.  Around the datestamp (probably not a popular option to leave turned on) there is a lot of JPEG noise.<br/> <br/>On the up side, the composition seems pretty nice, though the train may be just a touch dark.<br/> <br/>I assume that you have a low end camera, so I feel your pain.  I had a cheap Kodak point-and-shoot for a long time which produced very blocky looking images.  I hope you can get a better camera soon!</td>', 'This is going to score low because of the harsh JPEG compression visible: in the blue of the ice, there are blocky JPEG artifacts.  Around the datestamp (probably not a popular option to leave turned on) there is a lot of JPEG noise. On the up side, the composition seems pretty nice, though the train may be just a touch dark. I assume that you have a low end camera, so I feel your pain.  I had a cheap Kodak point-and-shoot for a long time which produced very blocky looking images.  I hope you can get a better camera soon!', '2006-10-24 18:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958336, 415153, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The focus on the face looks just a touch soft, but not bad.  It looks like the sharpest focus is on his forearm.<br/> <br/>I like the slight flim-grain/noise in here.  Great human element, and way to capture a very natural looking pose.</td>', 'Great shot!  The focus on the face looks just a touch soft, but not bad.  It looks like the sharpest focus is on his forearm. I like the slight flim-grain/noise in here.  Great human element, and way to capture a very natural looking pose.', '2006-10-24 18:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958342, 413838, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I like the dynamic range (it''s not a flat black and white image) and the crisp focus.  Great atmosphere (literally?) too.</td>', 'Great shot!  I like the dynamic range (it''s not a flat black and white image) and the crisp focus.  Great atmosphere (literally?) too.', '2006-10-24 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958348, 414213, 65858, '<td valign="top">Clever title - very cute shot.  Nice colors, though some of the branches against the sky look a bit over-sharpened.</td>', 'Clever title - very cute shot.  Nice colors, though some of the branches against the sky look a bit over-sharpened.', '2006-10-24 18:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958415, 415476, 64795, '<td valign="top">I really like the emotion captured and the PP.</td>', 'I really like the emotion captured and the PP.', '2006-10-24 19:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958416, 415355, 64795, '<td valign="top">Great horizontal composition.</td>', 'Great horizontal composition.', '2006-10-24 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958420, 415465, 64795, '<td valign="top">Wow! Where did this happen??</td>', 'Wow! Where did this happen??', '2006-10-24 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958422, 415177, 64795, '<td valign="top">Very nice and unique. I love it!</td>', 'Very nice and unique. I love it!', '2006-10-24 19:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958423, 415669, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love the artistic treatment of this image! Perfectly 19th century! Well, almost perfect...wondering why you chose not to carry the edge effect onto the right side of the frame... Nonetheless one of my highest votes goes to you.</td>', 'I love the artistic treatment of this image! Perfectly 19th century! Well, almost perfect...wondering why you chose not to carry the edge effect onto the right side of the frame... Nonetheless one of my highest votes goes to you.', '2006-10-24 19:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958424, 415477, 64795, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! This is amazing!</td>', 'Oh wow! This is amazing!', '2006-10-24 19:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958426, 415533, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely! You''ve taken the viewer to an unusual place! While this type of image often leaves me feeling dizzy this one doesn''t...the graphic lines have a wonderful power.</td>', 'Lovely! You''ve taken the viewer to an unusual place! While this type of image often leaves me feeling dizzy this one doesn''t...the graphic lines have a wonderful power.', '2006-10-24 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958464, 415436, 14476, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle.  Good one.</td>', 'Unusual angle.  Good one.', '2006-10-24 19:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958467, 415465, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s not pretty.  I hope those were empties, I know they can ferry some nasty stuff in tank cars (at least where I work).  Subject-wise, a great capture - looks like you even beat the emergency crews to the job.  Great journalism albeit potentially dangerous (see nasty stuff comment).  Photographically, there are some blown highlights, but they don''t affect the impact of the shot.  Nice work</td>', 'Wow.  That''s not pretty.  I hope those were empties, I know they can ferry some nasty stuff in tank cars (at least where I work).  Subject-wise, a great capture - looks like you even beat the emergency crews to the job.  Great journalism albeit potentially dangerous (see nasty stuff comment).  Photographically, there are some blown highlights, but they don''t affect the impact of the shot.  Nice work', '2006-10-24 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958470, 415526, 509, '<td valign="top">Looks like a tough exposure - underexposure to control the highlights and then some playing around with levels to restore contrast might help the colors/lighting.  Otherwise pretty good.</td>', 'Looks like a tough exposure - underexposure to control the highlights and then some playing around with levels to restore contrast might help the colors/lighting.  Otherwise pretty good.', '2006-10-24 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958560, 415198, 26464, '<td valign="top">really like it. kinda wish the marker/sign/(not sure what it is) at right wasn''t there.</td>', 'really like it. kinda wish the marker/sign/(not sure what it is) at right wasn''t there.', '2006-10-24 20:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958563, 415611, 26464, '<td valign="top">i wish the subject was a tiny bit sharper from the background.. but i still gave this an 8</td>', 'i wish the subject was a tiny bit sharper from the background.. but i still gave this an 8', '2006-10-24 20:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958564, 415177, 26464, '<td valign="top">very original 7.. you''re on the right track!</td>', 'very original 7.. you''re on the right track!', '2006-10-24 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958565, 415525, 26464, '<td valign="top">like the ''old city'' feel to this. 7</td>', 'like the ''old city'' feel to this. 7', '2006-10-24 20:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958612, 414213, 34396, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot.  My kid isn''t into trains, but what a great costume.  I think if you had changed the perspective point so that he was farther away and centered in the track, we would have imagined Thomas puffing down the rails.  I may have bumped it up a point or two but you got a good score none the less.  Good job.</td>', 'I really liked this shot.  My kid isn''t into trains, but what a great costume.  I think if you had changed the perspective point so that he was farther away and centered in the track, we would have imagined Thomas puffing down the rails.  I may have bumped it up a point or two but you got a good score none the less.  Good job.', '2006-10-24 20:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958616, 415519, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like the use of light and shadows here as well as the vanishing point of the rails.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like the use of light and shadows here as well as the vanishing point of the rails.', '2006-10-24 20:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958637, 415508, 34396, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all wish it were that easy to get a ride in the engine.  I like this image, great DOF, good expression, and funny.  I wonder if it would have had a bit more impact if the engine were a bit closer.  Good job!</td>', 'Don''t we all wish it were that easy to get a ride in the engine.  I like this image, great DOF, good expression, and funny.  I wonder if it would have had a bit more impact if the engine were a bit closer.  Good job!', '2006-10-24 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958646, 415214, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting bridge and a nice centered composition.  I don''t hold to that everything must use the "rule of thirds" mantra. This image looks great centered.  I like the contrasting colors and the sharpness of the image.  My one "nitpick", with all of the symetry going on, it''s a shame the bottom tie was tilted.  If you had cropped the roadbed out of the bottom, it might have masked that a bit more.  Overall, a good photo.</td>', 'An interesting bridge and a nice centered composition.  I don''t hold to that everything must use the "rule of thirds" mantra. This image looks great centered.  I like the contrasting colors and the sharpness of the image.  My one "nitpick", with all of the symetry going on, it''s a shame the bottom tie was tilted.  If you had cropped the roadbed out of the bottom, it might have masked that a bit more.  Overall, a good photo.', '2006-10-24 20:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958653, 415192, 34396, '<td valign="top">Hey, this photo is dark and grainy!  But you already knew that....  An interesting shot, and I''m not sure what would improve it.  From my perspective, the engine, or car to the left looks "pixelated".  If there was a way to get more clarity of the train, without losing the motion blur I would have bumped it up.  Good job.</td>', 'Hey, this photo is dark and grainy!  But you already knew that....  An interesting shot, and I''m not sure what would improve it.  From my perspective, the engine, or car to the left looks "pixelated".  If there was a way to get more clarity of the train, without losing the motion blur I would have bumped it up.  Good job.', '2006-10-24 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958657, 415175, 34396, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is trying to show too much to be very interesting.  It''s obviously still a busy trainyard, but there is nothing specific to focus on.  The sky seems to wash out the upper portion of the hills as well which distracts from the overall contrast.</td>', 'I think this shot is trying to show too much to be very interesting.  It''s obviously still a busy trainyard, but there is nothing specific to focus on.  The sky seems to wash out the upper portion of the hills as well which distracts from the overall contrast.', '2006-10-24 20:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958670, 415521, 34396, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  The beloved, yet no longer needed caboose.  Wanting to be useful, but relegated to standing still as a relic of the past.  I like this photo.  The colors are nice, but the sky is a bit overexposed which detracts from the overall impact.</td>', 'Ahhh.  The beloved, yet no longer needed caboose.  Wanting to be useful, but relegated to standing still as a relic of the past.  I like this photo.  The colors are nice, but the sky is a bit overexposed which detracts from the overall impact.', '2006-10-24 21:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958676, 415485, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting find.  They just don''t make buildings the way they used to!  I like the contrasting colors of the emblem and it''s surrounding stone work.</td>', 'An interesting find.  They just don''t make buildings the way they used to!  I like the contrasting colors of the emblem and it''s surrounding stone work.', '2006-10-24 21:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958682, 414304, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, and looks good in sepiatone.  I would have cropped the left of the photo to remove the people and car.  I don''t think it adds to the photo, and it takes away the nostalgic look I think you were going for.</td>', 'An interesting photo, and looks good in sepiatone.  I would have cropped the left of the photo to remove the people and car.  I don''t think it adds to the photo, and it takes away the nostalgic look I think you were going for.', '2006-10-24 21:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958694, 414591, 34396, '<td valign="top">Although this photo is interesting, a mix of contrasts, angles, and circles, it is very hard for me to relate this to railroads or trains.  Yes, I was able to pick out the rails in the forground behind the cross braces, but if I didn''t know what I was looking for, I don''t know if I would have spotted them.</td>', 'Although this photo is interesting, a mix of contrasts, angles, and circles, it is very hard for me to relate this to railroads or trains.  Yes, I was able to pick out the rails in the forground behind the cross braces, but if I didn''t know what I was looking for, I don''t know if I would have spotted them.', '2006-10-24 21:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958698, 415142, 34396, '<td valign="top">Woody, you''ll do anything to enter a challenge.  I like that about you, so I''m giving you a 5.  If there had been a cow in your cowcatcher, I might have bumped it to a 7!</td>', 'Woody, you''ll do anything to enter a challenge.  I like that about you, so I''m giving you a 5.  If there had been a cow in your cowcatcher, I might have bumped it to a 7!', '2006-10-24 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958701, 415156, 34396, '<td valign="top">This photo looks a bit washed out to me.  There seems to be a haze over the tracks, like glare from a window.</td>', 'This photo looks a bit washed out to me.  There seems to be a haze over the tracks, like glare from a window.', '2006-10-24 21:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958706, 415671, 34396, '<td valign="top">Again, the lonley caboose.  Although this one seems to have been abandoned with a "buddy".  Nice colors, but the front of the caboose seems a bit dark.  Hard to see any detail there.  I think you could have cropped a bit tighter, (less sky) to improve the shot.</td>', 'Again, the lonley caboose.  Although this one seems to have been abandoned with a "buddy".  Nice colors, but the front of the caboose seems a bit dark.  Hard to see any detail there.  I think you could have cropped a bit tighter, (less sky) to improve the shot.', '2006-10-24 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958718, 415339, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetrical photo.  The angles of the bridge are interesting and the sun casts a nice clow on the rails and bridge.  Unfortunately, the sun also seems a bit bright to the left of the photo, causing the blue sky to be all but washed out.  Otherwise, a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice symmetrical photo.  The angles of the bridge are interesting and the sun casts a nice clow on the rails and bridge.  Unfortunately, the sun also seems a bit bright to the left of the photo, causing the blue sky to be all but washed out.  Otherwise, a nice photo.', '2006-10-24 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958735, 413645, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and fitting Title.  Although I am not a "rule of thirds" fanatic, I think this photo might have benefited from it''s use. I would have cropped a large portion off the left, moving the engine into the "magic spot"  I don''t think the buildings and billboards add to the photo.  I do like the color of the sky contrasting with the silver and yellow of the train.</td>', 'Nice photo and fitting Title.  Although I am not a "rule of thirds" fanatic, I think this photo might have benefited from it''s use. I would have cropped a large portion off the left, moving the engine into the "magic spot"  I don''t think the buildings and billboards add to the photo.  I do like the color of the sky contrasting with the silver and yellow of the train.', '2006-10-24 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958751, 415190, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wow, wouldn''t it be fun to take a train through that kind of scenery!  Very nice capture.  I would have liked the sky to have a bit more contrast.  I''m not sure, but it looks like the photo might have been oversharpened.  There is a white halo around all of the mountains.</td>', 'Wow, wouldn''t it be fun to take a train through that kind of scenery!  Very nice capture.  I would have liked the sky to have a bit more contrast.  I''m not sure, but it looks like the photo might have been oversharpened.  There is a white halo around all of the mountains.', '2006-10-24 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958757, 415508, 24486, '<td valign="top">That one got a laugh out of me.</td>', 'That one got a laugh out of me.', '2006-10-24 21:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958776, 413358, 24486, '<td valign="top">This was my original concept but I couldn''t quite pull it off like you have. Having the people in the photograph not moving really makes the shot. Well done.</td>', 'This was my original concept but I couldn''t quite pull it off like you have. Having the people in the photograph not moving really makes the shot. Well done.', '2006-10-24 21:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958782, 414204, 66569, '<td valign="top">Very cool DOF, I just wished it were more focused on the rail stake (tie? I can''t remember what they''re called) rather than the rock/grass.</td>', 'Very cool DOF, I just wished it were more focused on the rail stake (tie? I can''t remember what they''re called) rather than the rock/grass.', '2006-10-24 21:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958813, 414232, 51802, '<td valign="top">Over processed for my taste.  The perspective brings interest but I can''t get past the processing.</td>', 'Over processed for my taste.  The perspective brings interest but I can''t get past the processing.', '2006-10-24 21:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958816, 414677, 56417, '<td valign="top">this is great...bump</td>', 'this is great...bump', '2006-10-24 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958817, 413324, 56417, '<td valign="top">very nice...bump</td>', 'very nice...bump', '2006-10-24 21:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958868, 413049, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point, excellent composition.</td>', 'Nice vantage point, excellent composition.', '2006-10-24 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958871, 415594, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow depth of field.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Great use of shallow depth of field.  Nice shot!', '2006-10-24 22:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958891, 413454, 24486, '<td valign="top">Great candid but I don''t think you should of made the border so wide.</td>', 'Great candid but I don''t think you should of made the border so wide.', '2006-10-24 22:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958906, 415501, 30049, '<td valign="top">Norfolk - but you probably already know that by now.  :D  I like the B/W processing you''ve done on this.  You covered the range quite nicely.  The POV works well with the gentle curving line taking the viewer thru the image.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Norfolk - but you probably already know that by now.  :D  I like the B/W processing you''ve done on this.  You covered the range quite nicely.  The POV works well with the gentle curving line taking the viewer thru the image.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 22:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958918, 414164, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  Something about the composition is uncomfortable with all of that blank grey sky surrounding a near-centered column.  Being that this is an advanced editing challenge you could have legally cloned out the bits of tree leaves at the bottom.  Wish I could offer more constructive feedback, but I''m at a loss for assistance on this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  Something about the composition is uncomfortable with all of that blank grey sky surrounding a near-centered column.  Being that this is an advanced editing challenge you could have legally cloned out the bits of tree leaves at the bottom.  Wish I could offer more constructive feedback, but I''m at a loss for assistance on this one.  Good luck.', '2006-10-24 22:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958924, 415477, 30049, '<td valign="top">A very cool geometric shot that is well processed and interesting to look at.  Trying to associate it with trains &amp; railroads is going to be a leap of faith for many I''m afraid.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very cool geometric shot that is well processed and interesting to look at.  Trying to associate it with trains & railroads is going to be a leap of faith for many I''m afraid.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 22:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958928, 415167, 24486, '<td valign="top">Very surreal</td>', 'Very surreal', '2006-10-24 22:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958930, 415370, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool looking train!  The image itself is fine.  Nothing really wrong with it technically that I can see at first glance, but nothing is jumping out for attention either.  Kind of an ok, average view.  Sorry, JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool looking train!  The image itself is fine.  Nothing really wrong with it technically that I can see at first glance, but nothing is jumping out for attention either.  Kind of an ok, average view.  Sorry, JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958931, 413492, 29770, '<td valign="top">I love the simple rustic feel of this image.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'I love the simple rustic feel of this image.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2006-10-24 22:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958935, 415326, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a neat view.  Quite colorful (perhaps too colorful - ease up on the saturation a tad there would ya?  :D)  Actually I''m glad to see some color as there are numerous B/W photos in this challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a neat view.  Quite colorful (perhaps too colorful - ease up on the saturation a tad there would ya?  :D)  Actually I''m glad to see some color as there are numerous B/W photos in this challenge.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-24 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
