(2958952, 415533, 24486, '<td valign="top">Definetly a top contender in this challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'Definetly a top contender in this challenge in my opinion.', '2006-10-24 22:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958954, 414707, 327, '<td valign="top">Is that Portland? :) Love that you captured the whole building and your tones are perfect.<br/> <br/>www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=55582</td>', 'Is that Portland? :) Love that you captured the whole building and your tones are perfect. www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=55582', '2006-10-24 22:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958958, 414783, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant perspective. Very Nicely timed.</td>', 'Excellant perspective. Very Nicely timed.', '2006-10-24 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958962, 415212, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Good</td>', 'Love the colors. Good', '2006-10-24 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958991, 414204, 31403, '<td valign="top">only the rocks are in focus - sorry</td>', 'only the rocks are in focus - sorry', '2006-10-24 22:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959005, 414870, 31403, '<td valign="top">darken those blacks more, and crop down to the person and the three lights and I''ll give you an 8 and consider you for the best image of the challenge - but all that extra "stuff" really dilutes this.  6</td>', 'darken those blacks more, and crop down to the person and the three lights and I''ll give you an 8 and consider you for the best image of the challenge - but all that extra "stuff" really dilutes this.  6', '2006-10-24 22:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959027, 415097, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is the viewpoint that I usually see trains from so it feels like a snapshot from the start - plus it looks like your white balance was off, and there''s a complete lack of contrast.<br/> <br/>Show me the train from your viewpoint, from the viewpoint that shows me why you think this particular train is cool - then it starts to become art.  The WB and the contrast come with getting to know your camera better.  2</td>', 'this is the viewpoint that I usually see trains from so it feels like a snapshot from the start - plus it looks like your white balance was off, and there''s a complete lack of contrast. Show me the train from your viewpoint, from the viewpoint that shows me why you think this particular train is cool - then it starts to become art.  The WB and the contrast come with getting to know your camera better.  2', '2006-10-24 23:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959031, 415649, 31403, '<td valign="top">the lack of focus in the main subject makes it hard to give this a very high score</td>', 'the lack of focus in the main subject makes it hard to give this a very high score', '2006-10-24 23:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959039, 415523, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the texture here</td>', 'love the texture here', '2006-10-24 23:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959046, 415136, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way the diagonal puts them nicely in the corner, and I like the spots of color in the vest, reflection, and sleeve.</td>', 'I like the way the diagonal puts them nicely in the corner, and I like the spots of color in the vest, reflection, and sleeve.', '2006-10-24 23:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959049, 414681, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool PP to one of the newer engines on the tracks!  Love the design GE put in them - but your processing is beautiful.  Love the angle of the engine to the cars too.  Nice work.  7</td>', 'cool PP to one of the newer engines on the tracks!  Love the design GE put in them - but your processing is beautiful.  Love the angle of the engine to the cars too.  Nice work.  7', '2006-10-24 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959051, 414204, 30982, '<td valign="top">As I suspect you intended, the rock is what draws the eye first, then the second tie.  Very appropriate to your title and I''m assuming your intentions, though I suspect most will be put off by the very shallow DOF.</td>', 'As I suspect you intended, the rock is what draws the eye first, then the second tie.  Very appropriate to your title and I''m assuming your intentions, though I suspect most will be put off by the very shallow DOF.', '2006-10-24 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959052, 415604, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow, she''s REALLY tied up!  Do we owe these images to movies?  I wonder if a woman ever really perished in this way.<br/> <br/>Fun image nonetheless - great PP</td>', 'wow, she''s REALLY tied up!  Do we owe these images to movies?  I wonder if a woman ever really perished in this way. Fun image nonetheless - great PP', '2006-10-24 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959055, 415671, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love these old cars.  I think I''d like to see it more from a vantage point a little further to the photographer''s left.  The red is very rich and lovely in this.</td>', 'I love these old cars.  I think I''d like to see it more from a vantage point a little further to the photographer''s left.  The red is very rich and lovely in this.', '2006-10-24 23:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959057, 415192, 30982, '<td valign="top">But you''re supposed to get out of the car!  Neat perspective to capture, though, since it''s the way we all see trains at crossings.  B&amp;W works well for this.</td>', 'But you''re supposed to get out of the car!  Neat perspective to capture, though, since it''s the way we all see trains at crossings.  B&W works well for this.', '2006-10-24 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959058, 414420, 31403, '<td valign="top">ghostly cool!  Thank you for actually composing your IR shot.  This is cool.</td>', 'ghostly cool!  Thank you for actually composing your IR shot.  This is cool.', '2006-10-24 23:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959064, 412678, 31403, '<td valign="top">a woman in a evening gown half way down that car would cap this to perfection!  Nice capture of a great location!</td>', 'a woman in a evening gown half way down that car would cap this to perfection!  Nice capture of a great location!', '2006-10-24 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959065, 415212, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely take on the challenge.  I like the pinks near the top.</td>', 'Quite a lovely take on the challenge.  I like the pinks near the top.', '2006-10-24 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2959067, 415519, 31403, '<td valign="top">great thought to include the person - very nice work - 8 for now</td>', 'great thought to include the person - very nice work - 8 for now', '2006-10-24 23:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959071, 415650, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  I think you spelled gauge wrong (how''s that for nitpicking?) but this is a striking picture.  Nice composition with the steam/smoke echoing the shape of the hill; nice color as well, except the sky doesn''t seem to quite match the toning of the rest of the shot (though I''m sure it was that color.)</td>', 'Oh my!  I think you spelled gauge wrong (how''s that for nitpicking?) but this is a striking picture.  Nice composition with the steam/smoke echoing the shape of the hill; nice color as well, except the sky doesn''t seem to quite match the toning of the rest of the shot (though I''m sure it was that color.)', '2006-10-24 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959076, 414177, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice!  Lovely artwork (I like train graffiti that''s done well) and nice decision to catch it in motion.  Colors are excellent.</td>', 'Nice choice!  Lovely artwork (I like train graffiti that''s done well) and nice decision to catch it in motion.  Colors are excellent.', '2006-10-24 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959084, 415651, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the idea behind this shot and the colors are pretty good (though the sky is a tad darkish).  If it were me, I''d have the sign closer to the right side of the picture, cropping to just the left of the "U", but that''s just my personal preference.</td>', 'I love the idea behind this shot and the colors are pretty good (though the sky is a tad darkish).  If it were me, I''d have the sign closer to the right side of the picture, cropping to just the left of the "U", but that''s just my personal preference.', '2006-10-24 23:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959089, 413880, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and I like the rust on the bolts and the long shadows.  A bit lacking in depth/perspective because of the head-on shot, though.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and I like the rust on the bolts and the long shadows.  A bit lacking in depth/perspective because of the head-on shot, though.', '2006-10-24 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959094, 415436, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is cool - great perspective and nice colors</td>', 'this is cool - great perspective and nice colors', '2006-10-24 23:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959099, 413324, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice study in texture, color and form.  Nicely processed as well.</td>', 'Nice study in texture, color and form.  Nicely processed as well.', '2006-10-24 23:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959100, 415454, 30982, '<td valign="top">The main point of interest, to me, is the blur of motion in the background, in trying to figure it out.</td>', 'The main point of interest, to me, is the blur of motion in the background, in trying to figure it out.', '2006-10-24 23:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959111, 414164, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Very funny sign!  As far as a photograph goes, it''s a bit bland - maybe less centered and more of an angle?  Points for humor, though.</td>', 'Heh!  Very funny sign!  As far as a photograph goes, it''s a bit bland - maybe less centered and more of an angle?  Points for humor, though.', '2006-10-24 23:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
