(2960020, 415436, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very striking perspective, lines and colors</td>', 'Very striking perspective, lines and colors', '2006-10-25 03:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960023, 415049, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great colors and nice composition</td>', 'Great colors and nice composition', '2006-10-25 03:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960057, 415136, 25355, '<td valign="top">That seems like Eastern Europe to me. I wonder where it is... I7ll find out next week, of course. ;-)</td>', 'That seems like Eastern Europe to me. I wonder where it is... I7ll find out next week, of course. ;-)', '2006-10-25 04:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960061, 415233, 25355, '<td valign="top">Hehe, an Icelander did get into the act! Albeit with some rails used for launching a boat (perhaps a lifeboat?) into the sea. Good luck. ;-)</td>', 'Hehe, an Icelander did get into the act! Albeit with some rails used for launching a boat (perhaps a lifeboat?) into the sea. Good luck. ;-)', '2006-10-25 04:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960238, 414204, 58592, '<td valign="top">Not exactly out of the box approach, but at least is well done. A nine from me. Keep up with the good work</td>', 'Not exactly out of the box approach, but at least is well done. A nine from me. Keep up with the good work', '2006-10-25 06:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960241, 414603, 58592, '<td valign="top">Nice work, you got a tenner from me :-)</td>', 'Nice work, you got a tenner from me :-)', '2006-10-25 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960247, 414307, 58592, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice 3d feeling.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice 3d feeling.', '2006-10-25 07:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960482, 414232, 52854, '<td valign="top">I really like it. Great strong photo! 9</td>', 'I really like it. Great strong photo! 9', '2006-10-25 08:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960588, 415245, 9149, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2006-10-25 09:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960701, 415476, 61233, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I sent chills up and down my spine just to see it. Good job.</td>', 'I like this photo. I sent chills up and down my spine just to see it. Good job.', '2006-10-25 09:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960769, 414213, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like kids and the Thomas The Train thing is cute, but you really have yourself a GREAT composition here without him.  Without, I would probably have rated this a 9+, but he is obstructing my view abit so 7.</td>', 'I like kids and the Thomas The Train thing is cute, but you really have yourself a GREAT composition here without him.  Without, I would probably have rated this a 9+, but he is obstructing my view abit so 7.', '2006-10-25 10:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960772, 415474, 64175, '<td valign="top">The subject looks more like they are laughing than crying for help IMO.  The composition and coloring are good. I like the amount of noise or blur in the background too.  6.</td>', 'The subject looks more like they are laughing than crying for help IMO.  The composition and coloring are good. I like the amount of noise or blur in the background too.  6.', '2006-10-25 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960773, 415651, 64175, '<td valign="top">The colors and composition are fantastic.  I wish it had been taken at a faster shutter so that the train was not blurred. Rather than appear moving, it just appears out of focus to the viewer. 6.</td>', 'The colors and composition are fantastic.  I wish it had been taken at a faster shutter so that the train was not blurred. Rather than appear moving, it just appears out of focus to the viewer. 6.', '2006-10-25 10:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960775, 415049, 64175, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was done in post processing or if it was due to the outside lighting, but the image has a bit too much red in it (it ''oranges'' the overall photo and takes away from some of the great colors in the composition.  6.</td>', 'Not sure if it was done in post processing or if it was due to the outside lighting, but the image has a bit too much red in it (it ''oranges'' the overall photo and takes away from some of the great colors in the composition.  6.', '2006-10-25 10:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960785, 413492, 64175, '<td valign="top">From the image, (without looking at title) I first thought it was a DNMC image as it looks like a barn door or something. But then realized it may be an old boxcar and then saw the title.</td>', 'From the image, (without looking at title) I first thought it was a DNMC image as it looks like a barn door or something. But then realized it may be an old boxcar and then saw the title.', '2006-10-25 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960792, 415156, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the shot, but the use of the selective color actually takes away from the photo IMO on this shot.</td>', 'I like the composition of the shot, but the use of the selective color actually takes away from the photo IMO on this shot.', '2006-10-25 10:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960795, 414590, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the engine is so  small and placed so far to the side that I have to go looking for it.  The perspective is nice with the elongated track and colors are fine, the composition just needs a little tweaking.</td>', 'I like the concept but the engine is so  small and placed so far to the side that I have to go looking for it.  The perspective is nice with the elongated track and colors are fine, the composition just needs a little tweaking.', '2006-10-25 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960796, 414869, 64175, '<td valign="top">The image is very good technically but the subject of the photo just is a bit bland IMO.</td>', 'The image is very good technically but the subject of the photo just is a bit bland IMO.', '2006-10-25 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960797, 415233, 64175, '<td valign="top">The northern lights are very nice. The lighting on the pile of rubble and trash is nice, but I don''t really get a railroad feel from it. I get more of a trash pile accumlated on the shore line and that the pile includes two strips of iron.  <br/> <br/>The technical composition of the photo is quite nice. It just doesn''t rate strongly in the challenge perspective for me.</td>', 'The northern lights are very nice. The lighting on the pile of rubble and trash is nice, but I don''t really get a railroad feel from it. I get more of a trash pile accumlated on the shore line and that the pile includes two strips of iron.   The technical composition of the photo is quite nice. It just doesn''t rate strongly in the challenge perspective for me.', '2006-10-25 10:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960798, 415459, 64175, '<td valign="top">The light from the road across the photo looks as if something happened during the shot and a line of the photo was not exposed.</td>', 'The light from the road across the photo looks as if something happened during the shot and a line of the photo was not exposed.', '2006-10-25 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960799, 415443, 64175, '<td valign="top">Such a thick border on top/bottom actually distracts from the image.</td>', 'Such a thick border on top/bottom actually distracts from the image.', '2006-10-25 10:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960805, 414623, 64175, '<td valign="top">The railroad (tracks) seem like an afterthought in this photo. It is a nice photo of the chair on a beaten pathway, but it doesn''t scream "train" to the viewer.</td>', 'The railroad (tracks) seem like an afterthought in this photo. It is a nice photo of the chair on a beaten pathway, but it doesn''t scream "train" to the viewer.', '2006-10-25 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960808, 414485, 64175, '<td valign="top">The tracks may be in the photo, but they appear to be an afterthought for this photo which looks more like a car commercial photo.</td>', 'The tracks may be in the photo, but they appear to be an afterthought for this photo which looks more like a car commercial photo.', '2006-10-25 10:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960811, 415193, 64175, '<td valign="top">The challenge was definitely met, but the image is very pixelated.  It looks as if the photo setting on the camera was too low (for compression) and thus the image comes out pixelated/grainy/slightly out of focus.</td>', 'The challenge was definitely met, but the image is very pixelated.  It looks as if the photo setting on the camera was too low (for compression) and thus the image comes out pixelated/grainy/slightly out of focus.', '2006-10-25 10:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960813, 414204, 64175, '<td valign="top">The focus appears to have been made on the rock to the left rather than the railroad spike in the middle.  I would have prefered the spike be in focus and then the DOF kick in.</td>', 'The focus appears to have been made on the rock to the left rather than the railroad spike in the middle.  I would have prefered the spike be in focus and then the DOF kick in.', '2006-10-25 10:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960814, 415516, 64175, '<td valign="top">The person is definitely waiting, but the viewer would as "for what"?  He appears to be waiting for the restaurant to open , or for a ride to arrive, but the image doesn''t really have anything to convey that he is at a train station or awaiting a train.</td>', 'The person is definitely waiting, but the viewer would as "for what"?  He appears to be waiting for the restaurant to open , or for a ride to arrive, but the image doesn''t really have anything to convey that he is at a train station or awaiting a train.', '2006-10-25 10:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960815, 414223, 64175, '<td valign="top">The image is quite out of focus.</td>', 'The image is quite out of focus.', '2006-10-25 10:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960816, 414652, 64175, '<td valign="top">I negative image with some blues or something might convey the ''ghost'' effect better.  IMO the image is just too washed out.</td>', 'I negative image with some blues or something might convey the ''ghost'' effect better.  IMO the image is just too washed out.', '2006-10-25 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961011, 415115, 16488, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this image (and so far that''s at least 5) I like it more! the image of the lonely woman in a stark station just works. The color blocking throughout proves pleasing in composition. Nice mood and sense of place!</td>', 'Every time I look at this image (and so far that''s at least 5) I like it more! the image of the lonely woman in a stark station just works. The color blocking throughout proves pleasing in composition. Nice mood and sense of place!', '2006-10-25 11:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961171, 414707, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'This is quite nice b&w.', '2006-10-25 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961180, 415243, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice poust processing.</td>', 'Nice poust processing.', '2006-10-25 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961183, 415443, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very creative angle and focus.</td>', 'Very creative angle and focus.', '2006-10-25 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
