(2963109, 413141, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The contrasting colors and textures are very nice.  I would have rotated the crop a bit to make the "Superheater" plaque line up with the top of the frame.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this photo.  The contrasting colors and textures are very nice.  I would have rotated the crop a bit to make the "Superheater" plaque line up with the top of the frame.  Good job.', '2006-10-25 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963168, 414291, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that you included the "artist" in this shot and that you chose a bit of an angle.</td>', 'I like that you included the "artist" in this shot and that you chose a bit of an angle.', '2006-10-25 20:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963171, 415117, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very lonely feeling here, but one of anticipation - just around the corner there may be a train with people getting on and off.  Or not.  I think that''s what I like about it.</td>', 'A very lonely feeling here, but one of anticipation - just around the corner there may be a train with people getting on and off.  Or not.  I think that''s what I like about it.', '2006-10-25 20:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963179, 415481, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very strong leading line - definitely pulls the viewer into the picture.  For this reason, I think I''d like to see a bit greater DOF - pull me along a bit further before it starts to fade out.  Great angle.</td>', 'Very strong leading line - definitely pulls the viewer into the picture.  For this reason, I think I''d like to see a bit greater DOF - pull me along a bit further before it starts to fade out.  Great angle.', '2006-10-25 20:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963186, 415190, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colors of the train and foreground are good; sky looks a tad aqua but skies have a tendency to do that.  Nice composition with the slant of the mountains going down the same direction the train is headed.  Could be a bit sharper as far as definition of the train, maybe.</td>', 'Colors of the train and foreground are good; sky looks a tad aqua but skies have a tendency to do that.  Nice composition with the slant of the mountains going down the same direction the train is headed.  Could be a bit sharper as far as definition of the train, maybe.', '2006-10-25 20:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963196, 415110, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, and I haven''t even voted in that challenge yet!  I do like this - but I think having a bit deeper depth of field would be nice - let us see just a bit of that second rail.</td>', 'Nice bokeh, and I haven''t even voted in that challenge yet!  I do like this - but I think having a bit deeper depth of field would be nice - let us see just a bit of that second rail.', '2006-10-25 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963205, 413049, 30982, '<td valign="top">The overcast nature of the day unfortunately left you with a bit of a lack in contrast and sorta muddy colors.  The angle you chose, though, adds interest and the composition is fairly well balanced.</td>', 'The overcast nature of the day unfortunately left you with a bit of a lack in contrast and sorta muddy colors.  The angle you chose, though, adds interest and the composition is fairly well balanced.', '2006-10-25 20:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963228, 415283, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and seems well exposed with good even light but lacks a point of interest or a "story" to tell.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and seems well exposed with good even light but lacks a point of interest or a "story" to tell.', '2006-10-25 20:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963230, 415443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast, nice angle!</td>', 'Very good contrast, nice angle!', '2006-10-25 20:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963232, 415327, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  My only quibble is I''m not fond of the bit of red at the front.  I do like the pirate flag, though!</td>', 'Nice find!  My only quibble is I''m not fond of the bit of red at the front.  I do like the pirate flag, though!', '2006-10-25 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963241, 415284, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a lovely train station - I''ve been there!  The faces seem just a touch red to me - maybe too much of a boost in saturation?</td>', 'This is indeed a lovely train station - I''ve been there!  The faces seem just a touch red to me - maybe too much of a boost in saturation?', '2006-10-25 20:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963244, 415458, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.</td>', 'Very lovely.', '2006-10-25 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963247, 414901, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup shot - the words definitely draw the eye first then the rest is there to be explored.  Good job with such a shiny surface, too.</td>', 'Nice closeup shot - the words definitely draw the eye first then the rest is there to be explored.  Good job with such a shiny surface, too.', '2006-10-25 21:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963248, 415243, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sky makes the picture in this one - nice toning.</td>', 'The sky makes the picture in this one - nice toning.', '2006-10-25 21:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963260, 415048, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet choice of a closeup - love the "face"; nice processing, too.</td>', 'Sweet choice of a closeup - love the "face"; nice processing, too.', '2006-10-25 21:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963305, 415537, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the idea of this, and especially the sky.  The part that kinda bothers me a bit is his arm cuttingoff the bridge, though I''m not sure why.  I guess because it breaks that line.  Still a good shot, though.</td>', 'I quite like the idea of this, and especially the sky.  The part that kinda bothers me a bit is his arm cuttingoff the bridge, though I''m not sure why.  I guess because it breaks that line.  Still a good shot, though.', '2006-10-25 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963312, 415474, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  She looks more like she''s cracking up than yelling help.  The boots are a lovely touch, as is the hat!</td>', 'LOL!  She looks more like she''s cracking up than yelling help.  The boots are a lovely touch, as is the hat!', '2006-10-25 21:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963317, 414738, 30982, '<td valign="top">The purple streamers have got to go.  They totally detract from the ambience.  Not that you need to take them out of your photograph - in a way it''s the clash of the streamers against the richness of the train car that make this an interesting photograph.  I might like to see it shot from a much lower perspective as well.</td>', 'The purple streamers have got to go.  They totally detract from the ambience.  Not that you need to take them out of your photograph - in a way it''s the clash of the streamers against the richness of the train car that make this an interesting photograph.  I might like to see it shot from a much lower perspective as well.', '2006-10-25 21:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963324, 415079, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of IR (but I''m a rarity so that''s good) but I do like the composition of this quite well.</td>', 'Not a fan of IR (but I''m a rarity so that''s good) but I do like the composition of this quite well.', '2006-10-25 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
