(2963338, 415321, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the smile on the front of the train.  Compositionally it might benefit from a bit more picture on the left, but I like the inclusion of the farm in the background on the right - adds nicely to the ambience.</td>', 'I like the smile on the front of the train.  Compositionally it might benefit from a bit more picture on the left, but I like the inclusion of the farm in the background on the right - adds nicely to the ambience.', '2006-10-25 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
