(2967291, 415158, 57886, '<td valign="top">Wow, great colors, love the bike and the wet ground :o) The lights are a little disturbing but... overall nice...</td>', 'Wow, great colors, love the bike and the wet ground :o) The lights are a little disturbing but... overall nice...', '2006-10-27 06:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
