(2967616, 415193, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but a bit fuzzy and I think I''m seeing sharpening artifacts around the edges of the train.  Shame about the date being on it.</td>', 'Nice composition, but a bit fuzzy and I think I''m seeing sharpening artifacts around the edges of the train.  Shame about the date being on it.', '2006-10-27 10:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
