(2968102, 415109, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright, well its a train, and a sky.  Huh?  Well its simple thats for sure.  Its also my top finisher.  I don''t know how you did it, but you went simple, and you got brilliant.  Fantastic image.</td>', 'Alright, well its a train, and a sky.  Huh?  Well its simple thats for sure.  Its also my top finisher.  I don''t know how you did it, but you went simple, and you got brilliant.  Fantastic image.', '2006-10-27 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
