(2968106, 414738, 30637, '<td valign="top">I think there is no travel more elegant than by train!</td>', 'I think there is no travel more elegant than by train!', '2006-10-27 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968113, 415112, 24073, '<td valign="top">I got this one right up there amongst the top finishers.  Great image.  The sky at the top would be cool if it were a bit more dynamic.  I''m sure you already know this, but if you have Adobe you can go to Adjustments&gt;Selective Color&gt;Blues and/or Cyan.  I wonder what it would look like if that color was burned in there a little more?</td>', 'I got this one right up there amongst the top finishers.  Great image.  The sky at the top would be cool if it were a bit more dynamic.  I''m sure you already know this, but if you have Adobe you can go to Adjustments>Selective Color>Blues and/or Cyan.  I wonder what it would look like if that color was burned in there a little more?', '2006-10-27 12:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968125, 414677, 30637, '<td valign="top">Where broken dreams and memories meet</td>', 'Where broken dreams and memories meet', '2006-10-27 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968126, 415665, 24073, '<td valign="top">Very very cool.  It seems spotty though on the processing, for the most part it is brilliant, but there are some spots that just seem out of place.  The trees at about 1 o''clock look blurred then erased, and then the bushes right beside the tracks at about 8 o''clock look the same.  The blur itself seems an awesome teqnique, but the opacity in the erased spots should be brought down just a little.  I hope I havent assumed the wrong things, and an overall awesome photo.</td>', 'Very very cool.  It seems spotty though on the processing, for the most part it is brilliant, but there are some spots that just seem out of place.  The trees at about 1 o''clock look blurred then erased, and then the bushes right beside the tracks at about 8 o''clock look the same.  The blur itself seems an awesome teqnique, but the opacity in the erased spots should be brought down just a little.  I hope I havent assumed the wrong things, and an overall awesome photo.', '2006-10-27 12:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968131, 415113, 30637, '<td valign="top">There''s a couple of pics over at //www.sightphoto.com/sightphoto/timeandplace/timeandplace05.html that is very similar. A wonderful photo site, I love to browse through it.</td>', 'There''s a couple of pics over at //www.sightphoto.com/sightphoto/timeandplace/timeandplace05.html that is very similar. A wonderful photo site, I love to browse through it.', '2006-10-27 13:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968135, 415474, 30637, '<td valign="top">And where is Jones?</td>', 'And where is Jones?', '2006-10-27 13:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968139, 415245, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The sky seems the perfect color to have brought in otherwise distracting elements.  Like the poles, the grain buildings, and water tower.  With the sky the way it is, it seems to build charachter, but with say a bright blue sky, I think these elements would be distracting.</td>', 'Well done.  The sky seems the perfect color to have brought in otherwise distracting elements.  Like the poles, the grain buildings, and water tower.  With the sky the way it is, it seems to build charachter, but with say a bright blue sky, I think these elements would be distracting.', '2006-10-27 13:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968149, 415452, 24073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, and beautiful set-up.  I dont know though, I think I would of liked the colors.  Still in the mix of the top contenders in my book.</td>', 'Beautiful model, and beautiful set-up.  I dont know though, I think I would of liked the colors.  Still in the mix of the top contenders in my book.', '2006-10-27 13:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968158, 412886, 24073, '<td valign="top">very nice image, but I''m finding myself cocking my head to the left.  It seems a bit crooked.  Owe yeah, and I like your choice with the border.</td>', 'very nice image, but I''m finding myself cocking my head to the left.  It seems a bit crooked.  Owe yeah, and I like your choice with the border.', '2006-10-27 13:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968166, 414304, 24073, '<td valign="top">This image spurs imagination.  I find myself creating stories in my head of the town, of the people, and of course of the train tracks.  Very cool.</td>', 'This image spurs imagination.  I find myself creating stories in my head of the town, of the people, and of course of the train tracks.  Very cool.', '2006-10-27 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968173, 415465, 24073, '<td valign="top">I personally like to laugh, and its a nice break from voting.  Not only that, but humor is a huge part of photography.  Its also of trains and railroads, and the execution on your part is brilliant, standing way far up so we can see the scope of it, and the town for a neat story.  Very very good.</td>', 'I personally like to laugh, and its a nice break from voting.  Not only that, but humor is a huge part of photography.  Its also of trains and railroads, and the execution on your part is brilliant, standing way far up so we can see the scope of it, and the town for a neat story.  Very very good.', '2006-10-27 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968178, 415465, 59029, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2006-10-27 13:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968180, 415164, 24073, '<td valign="top">Owe yeah, very very good. I like the idea, I like the execution, and I like the fact that I can''t think of one other photo from inside the train.  Super cool.  GL.</td>', 'Owe yeah, very very good. I like the idea, I like the execution, and I like the fact that I can''t think of one other photo from inside the train.  Super cool.  GL.', '2006-10-27 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
