(2968246, 415665, 58610, '<td valign="top">Interesting blurring effect on the trees, but a little too strong for my taste. Otherwise a very strong composition. I think I also would  have liked the right hand rail better disappearing right at the corner rather than above it.</td>', 'Interesting blurring effect on the trees, but a little too strong for my taste. Otherwise a very strong composition. I think I also would  have liked the right hand rail better disappearing right at the corner rather than above it.', '2006-10-27 14:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
