(2968270, 415596, 58610, '<td valign="top">The reason for calling this a Ghost Train seems a little vague to me. Is it just because of the post processing treatment, or is there another reason (i.e. local knowledge, folklore, metaphore from a song, etc.). As an image it is striking, but because it doesn''t match my picture of reality I''m having a hard time relating to it.</td>', 'The reason for calling this a Ghost Train seems a little vague to me. Is it just because of the post processing treatment, or is there another reason (i.e. local knowledge, folklore, metaphore from a song, etc.). As an image it is striking, but because it doesn''t match my picture of reality I''m having a hard time relating to it.', '2006-10-27 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968275, 415097, 23680, '<td valign="top">IMO the post processing makes this shot.  It looks like something in an old 50''s or 60''s photo album to me.   Post challenge I''d like to see this with a white border like the old time photos.</td>', 'IMO the post processing makes this shot.  It looks like something in an old 50''s or 60''s photo album to me.   Post challenge I''d like to see this with a white border like the old time photos.', '2006-10-27 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968284, 414040, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of rural America (or maybe Canada). The tracks disappearing off into the distant fog adds to the feeling of abandonment and neglect. I would have  liked it a little sharper I think, and just a little more detail in the shadowed trees overhead.</td>', 'Nice sense of rural America (or maybe Canada). The tracks disappearing off into the distant fog adds to the feeling of abandonment and neglect. I would have  liked it a little sharper I think, and just a little more detail in the shadowed trees overhead.', '2006-10-27 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
