(2968537, 413358, 64674, '<td valign="top">I was searching thru the entries, looking for one that was interesting.  There were a couple that captured a neat feeling but this is the shot I was looking for.  If I lived in a place that had trains, this would be the kind of shot I would try to get.  It must have been hard timing it to get just the end of the train. Very cool and neat photo. How good that the train is a nice red to make it pop even more. good job.</td>', 'I was searching thru the entries, looking for one that was interesting.  There were a couple that captured a neat feeling but this is the shot I was looking for.  If I lived in a place that had trains, this would be the kind of shot I would try to get.  It must have been hard timing it to get just the end of the train. Very cool and neat photo. How good that the train is a nice red to make it pop even more. good job.', '2006-10-27 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
