(2968640, 413169, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice metro scene. I, for one, certainly include trolly cars in the category of Trains and Rails. I hope others are as well. I like the inclusion here of the bicylist and the pedestrians as ballast to the story you''re telling. Your picture is well framed and exposed. Desaturation adds to the "coldness" of city life.</td>', 'Nice metro scene. I, for one, certainly include trolly cars in the category of Trains and Rails. I hope others are as well. I like the inclusion here of the bicylist and the pedestrians as ballast to the story you''re telling. Your picture is well framed and exposed. Desaturation adds to the "coldness" of city life.', '2006-10-27 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
