(2968975, 415115, 48890, '<td valign="top">Love the illusion of life in a lifeless place. 9</td>', 'Love the illusion of life in a lifeless place. 9', '2006-10-27 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968983, 415175, 58610, '<td valign="top">Here''s a broad sense of "what''s happening". It flows well, and tells a story.</td>', 'Here''s a broad sense of "what''s happening". It flows well, and tells a story.', '2006-10-27 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968984, 415474, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not believable at all.  Too tidy.</td>', 'Not believable at all.  Too tidy.', '2006-10-27 19:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2968997, 415665, 48890, '<td valign="top">The blur looks very unrealistic.  An over-processed shot, I think.</td>', 'The blur looks very unrealistic.  An over-processed shot, I think.', '2006-10-27 19:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969003, 414281, 48890, '<td valign="top">much overprocessed for my taste</td>', 'much overprocessed for my taste', '2006-10-27 19:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969016, 415236, 58610, '<td valign="top">England, right? Wonderful shot with lots of ''old world'' detail. I can just imagine the passengers queueing (sp?) up for the train.</td>', 'England, right? Wonderful shot with lots of ''old world'' detail. I can just imagine the passengers queueing (sp?) up for the train.', '2006-10-27 19:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969029, 414695, 48890, '<td valign="top">Way over-processed.</td>', 'Way over-processed.', '2006-10-27 19:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969031, 415459, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal quality of this photo. Dramatizes an otherwise ordinary scene. The track placement is well balanced.</td>', 'I like the surreal quality of this photo. Dramatizes an otherwise ordinary scene. The track placement is well balanced.', '2006-10-27 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969349, 415158, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image....I went WOW, but sadly I do not see any train tracks.  Is this for the bus?  Nice lighting and wonderful reflections, but I need to see something about trains.  Maybe you should have saved this one for the best of Oct? ps...I don''t mean this in an unfair way, I still voted this beautiful image highly!</td>', 'Beautiful image....I went WOW, but sadly I do not see any train tracks.  Is this for the bus?  Nice lighting and wonderful reflections, but I need to see something about trains.  Maybe you should have saved this one for the best of Oct? ps...I don''t mean this in an unfair way, I still voted this beautiful image highly!', '2006-10-27 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969354, 415458, 58676, '<td valign="top">The color contrast of the steam gives a cloudy effect. Gr8 work.</td>', 'The color contrast of the steam gives a cloudy effect. Gr8 work.', '2006-10-27 21:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969778, 415453, 29770, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and framing.  Nice and original.</td>', 'I like the colors and framing.  Nice and original.', '2006-10-27 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969794, 415277, 58610, '<td valign="top">Life is always the spoiler, isn''t it? As a piece of art this is  a srikingly rich photograph. As a commentary it points out the poverty of our societies'' response to real need. What a dichotomy for the photographer.</td>', 'Life is always the spoiler, isn''t it? As a piece of art this is  a srikingly rich photograph. As a commentary it points out the poverty of our societies'' response to real need. What a dichotomy for the photographer.', '2006-10-27 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969815, 415587, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like the "look" of this picture.  At first I didn''t like the angled background, but it grew on me.  Muted colors go well with with desserted station.</td>', 'I really like the "look" of this picture.  At first I didn''t like the angled background, but it grew on me.  Muted colors go well with with desserted station.', '2006-10-27 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969829, 415634, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good, strong color and I like the fact that you were close to the ground.  Perhaps taking it a bit from the side or focusing o nthe engine itself would add a bit more impact.</td>', 'Good, strong color and I like the fact that you were close to the ground.  Perhaps taking it a bit from the side or focusing o nthe engine itself would add a bit more impact.', '2006-10-27 23:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969836, 415650, 42495, '<td valign="top">Your picture has a lot going for it; especially the contrast between the smoke, mountains, and sky.  However, the smoke seems to overpower the train a bit.</td>', 'Your picture has a lot going for it; especially the contrast between the smoke, mountains, and sky.  However, the smoke seems to overpower the train a bit.', '2006-10-27 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969849, 415164, 42495, '<td valign="top">This has a great feel to it and the B&amp;W just adds to it.  The lady looking towards the camera is a standout.</td>', 'This has a great feel to it and the B&W just adds to it.  The lady looking towards the camera is a standout.', '2006-10-27 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969888, 414673, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and nice and sharp.  The fact that your model is far away and walking away makes me think she is indeed enjoying her world.  Great contrast between tracks.</td>', 'Good DOF and nice and sharp.  The fact that your model is far away and walking away makes me think she is indeed enjoying her world.  Great contrast between tracks.', '2006-10-27 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969958, 415145, 67694, '<td valign="top">Very strong image! Powerful!</td>', 'Very strong image! Powerful!', '2006-10-28 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969961, 415594, 67694, '<td valign="top">Nice macro</td>', 'Nice macro', '2006-10-28 00:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969971, 415191, 509, '<td valign="top">Pennsylvania RR museum?  I think a larger aperture might work here to blur some of the less important background elements - there isn''t really a strong central spot in the image that I can rest on.  Also, the image looks a little too smooth to me (as if too much neat image was applied).  This is a shot with potential but I think it could be done better to make it more appealing photographically imho.</td>', 'Pennsylvania RR museum?  I think a larger aperture might work here to blur some of the less important background elements - there isn''t really a strong central spot in the image that I can rest on.  Also, the image looks a little too smooth to me (as if too much neat image was applied).  This is a shot with potential but I think it could be done better to make it more appealing photographically imho.', '2006-10-28 00:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2969974, 415588, 67694, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of elements</td>', 'Nice mix of elements', '2006-10-28 00:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970325, 415504, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, I''d like to examine it more closely, but the image is too small.  Please see the tutorial on preparing your image for DPC.</td>', 'Nice lines, I''d like to examine it more closely, but the image is too small.  Please see the tutorial on preparing your image for DPC.', '2006-10-28 04:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970349, 415186, 64387, '<td valign="top">I can really feel the energy/speed/power in this photo.   <br/>This is my Winner. 10 from me.</td>', 'I can really feel the energy/speed/power in this photo.   This is my Winner. 10 from me.', '2006-10-28 05:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970374, 413838, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent symmetry and perspective.  Like the depth.  Not sure on the frame, but your call, obviously.</td>', '9 - Excellent symmetry and perspective.  Like the depth.  Not sure on the frame, but your call, obviously.', '2006-10-28 07:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970377, 415472, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image and composition.  Mainly the grain and to some extent the ''cloudiness'', detracts in my opinion, but fairly minor.  Likely just this medium, but would like to see more ''width'' but probably looks good as is wall sized.</td>', '7 - Nice image and composition.  Mainly the grain and to some extent the ''cloudiness'', detracts in my opinion, but fairly minor.  Likely just this medium, but would like to see more ''width'' but probably looks good as is wall sized.', '2006-10-28 07:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970382, 415587, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image and colors.  A more refined crop, especially left and bottom, quality dependent, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice image and colors.  A more refined crop, especially left and bottom, quality dependent, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-10-28 07:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970488, 415201, 56417, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot</td>', 'I really like this shot', '2006-10-28 09:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970526, 414707, 57429, '<td valign="top">Nice silver tones. Evokes a time when going by train was the fastest option</td>', 'Nice silver tones. Evokes a time when going by train was the fastest option', '2006-10-28 10:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970527, 415521, 57429, '<td valign="top">...or more steel rails....Very cute</td>', '...or more steel rails....Very cute', '2006-10-28 10:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970528, 415097, 57429, '<td valign="top">bit washed out</td>', 'bit washed out', '2006-10-28 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970530, 414485, 57429, '<td valign="top">If you have to explain it......</td>', 'If you have to explain it......', '2006-10-28 10:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970608, 415443, 509, '<td valign="top">Great angle!  Very creative abstract.  The duotone is nice here as well.  Maybe a little too much border, but not a major concern.</td>', 'Great angle!  Very creative abstract.  The duotone is nice here as well.  Maybe a little too much border, but not a major concern.', '2006-10-28 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970616, 413517, 509, '<td valign="top">Is this in Philly?  Not being familiar with driving through Philadelphia, I found one of these following me and was a bit surprised to see them still in service.  The angle and sharp focus throughout the image don''t really add much interest to the shot imho - in other words, a different take on the trolley (maybe from an angle someone wouldn''t typically see it from) might work well.  Its a good subject, I just think a less common presentation might better suit it.</td>', 'Is this in Philly?  Not being familiar with driving through Philadelphia, I found one of these following me and was a bit surprised to see them still in service.  The angle and sharp focus throughout the image don''t really add much interest to the shot imho - in other words, a different take on the trolley (maybe from an angle someone wouldn''t typically see it from) might work well.  Its a good subject, I just think a less common presentation might better suit it.', '2006-10-28 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970811, 415109, 45630, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2006-10-28 14:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970858, 415530, 23484, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  I love the processing on this one.</td>', 'nice shot.  I love the processing on this one.', '2006-10-28 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970879, 415650, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but it almost seems like there is too much smoke.</td>', 'This is a great shot but it almost seems like there is too much smoke.', '2006-10-28 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970964, 414291, 58610, '<td valign="top">You cut off his foot.</td>', 'You cut off his foot.', '2006-10-28 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970990, 415158, 58610, '<td valign="top">Probably blue.</td>', 'Probably blue.', '2006-10-28 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971001, 415533, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2006-10-28 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971004, 414695, 58610, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but missing a strong subject.</td>', 'Good picture, but missing a strong subject.', '2006-10-28 16:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971067, 415519, 66192, '<td valign="top">wow, hice shot. I would like to have seen it without subject.</td>', 'wow, hice shot. I would like to have seen it without subject.', '2006-10-28 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971070, 415284, 66192, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!<br/>I love that huge tree near this station.</td>', 'Nice shot!I love that huge tree near this station.', '2006-10-28 17:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971075, 415587, 66192, '<td valign="top">excellent composition! I wish i had your forsight. 10</td>', 'excellent composition! I wish i had your forsight. 10', '2006-10-28 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971088, 414652, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like the post processing.  Great title too. 8</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like the post processing.  Great title too. 8', '2006-10-28 17:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971089, 414677, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  This works well in B&amp;W. 7</td>', 'Nice shot.  This works well in B&W. 7', '2006-10-28 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971094, 413358, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the fact that you just caught the end of the train. 8</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the fact that you just caught the end of the train. 8', '2006-10-28 17:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971209, 414643, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the moving train.  The colors are perfect.7</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the moving train.  The colors are perfect.7', '2006-10-28 18:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971219, 415465, 67128, '<td valign="top">Love the title of this great picture.</td>', 'Love the title of this great picture.', '2006-10-28 18:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971221, 414223, 23484, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2006-10-28 18:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971231, 415245, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very simple but nicely done.  The colors are nice. 7</td>', 'Very simple but nicely done.  The colors are nice. 7', '2006-10-28 18:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971237, 415164, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  The softness around the edges is very nice.  It''s interesting that the people are right on that edge. 7</td>', 'Nice job.  The softness around the edges is very nice.  It''s interesting that the people are right on that edge. 7', '2006-10-28 18:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971267, 415112, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good choice of location to make the composition, and good timing to catch it there. Wish there had been a little more light on the engine/foreground; I understand rescheduling trains is not always an option : )</td>', 'Good choice of location to make the composition, and good timing to catch it there. Wish there had been a little more light on the engine/foreground; I understand rescheduling trains is not always an option : )', '2006-10-28 19:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971270, 415327, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s some smokestack!</td>', 'That''s some smokestack!', '2006-10-28 19:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971285, 415190, 1031, '<td valign="top">Way to take advantage of that handy backdrop : )</td>', 'Way to take advantage of that handy backdrop : )', '2006-10-28 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971288, 414677, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the funky wood structure on one side and the glass and metal one one the other.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the funky wood structure on one side and the glass and metal one one the other.', '2006-10-28 19:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971296, 414676, 1031, '<td valign="top">Contrasting colors make a great "yin-yang" effect.</td>', 'Contrasting colors make a great "yin-yang" effect.', '2006-10-28 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971308, 415465, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good place to be even farther away from : )<br/> <br/>Nice PJ capture -- did you get a version of this published?</td>', 'Looks like a good place to be even farther away from : ) Nice PJ capture -- did you get a version of this published?', '2006-10-28 19:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971356, 414420, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  It has a soft light sort of fell and the ir is great.</td>', 'This is cool.  It has a soft light sort of fell and the ir is great.', '2006-10-28 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971357, 415651, 59415, '<td valign="top">The slight blur gives it great feel of motion.</td>', 'The slight blur gives it great feel of motion.', '2006-10-28 20:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971359, 415521, 59415, '<td valign="top">Great humor, but artistically, it didn''t work for me.  There is nothing that I reall want to look at again in this photo. Sorry for the harshness. 5</td>', 'Great humor, but artistically, it didn''t work for me.  There is nothing that I reall want to look at again in this photo. Sorry for the harshness. 5', '2006-10-28 20:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971360, 415277, 59415, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think the man that you speak of takes over as the subject, and therefore I would need to see more to verify the title.  5</td>', 'Interesting.  I think the man that you speak of takes over as the subject, and therefore I would need to see more to verify the title.  5', '2006-10-28 20:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971361, 415588, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast and beautiful color.  This one is edited just right for my taste.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast and beautiful color.  This one is edited just right for my taste.', '2006-10-28 20:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971362, 415339, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I don''t know what I like, but I know that I do.</td>', 'Very cool, I don''t know what I like, but I know that I do.', '2006-10-28 20:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971363, 415670, 59415, '<td valign="top">Hey I know that guy!  Not really.</td>', 'Hey I know that guy!  Not really.', '2006-10-28 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971364, 413517, 59415, '<td valign="top">Good job of placement of the train in the frame.</td>', 'Good job of placement of the train in the frame.', '2006-10-28 20:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971365, 415634, 59415, '<td valign="top">Now that is my kind of train.</td>', 'Now that is my kind of train.', '2006-10-28 20:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971367, 415453, 59415, '<td valign="top">This should probably be a Christmas Card.  It is that good.</td>', 'This should probably be a Christmas Card.  It is that good.', '2006-10-28 20:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971368, 415435, 59415, '<td valign="top">Love the tone you picked.  Works well.</td>', 'Love the tone you picked.  Works well.', '2006-10-28 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971371, 415198, 59415, '<td valign="top">That is a cool train car, really makes the model stand out. I think you did a great job.</td>', 'That is a cool train car, really makes the model stand out. I think you did a great job.', '2006-10-28 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971373, 415079, 59415, '<td valign="top">Nothing fully grabs my eye.  I wish it was zoomed a bit more to the crossing sign. 5</td>', 'Nothing fully grabs my eye.  I wish it was zoomed a bit more to the crossing sign. 5', '2006-10-28 20:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971374, 414873, 59415, '<td valign="top">A little contrast on this, and I think it would have really brought it out.</td>', 'A little contrast on this, and I think it would have really brought it out.', '2006-10-28 20:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971376, 415212, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wow that is cool.  I would have never seen this coming in a million years.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow that is cool.  I would have never seen this coming in a million years.  Great job.', '2006-10-28 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971383, 415465, 59415, '<td valign="top">Holy cow.  I hope you win for being in the right place at the right time.  That is awsome.</td>', 'Holy cow.  I hope you win for being in the right place at the right time.  That is awsome.', '2006-10-28 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
