(2971471, 415193, 59029, '<td valign="top">Not a bad pic but must either change program on your camera so time/date stamp doesn''t show, or digitize it out of the finished pic.</td>', 'Not a bad pic but must either change program on your camera so time/date stamp doesn''t show, or digitize it out of the finished pic.', '2006-10-28 21:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
