(2971958, 415142, 34618, '<td valign="top">Cute, nice lighting and sharp but not especially inspiring. The creases on the backdrop are interesting, though I can''t decide if they add or subtract to the overall effect. It would be nice to see one with a smooth background. Not sure what you mean by "Horsepower" as far as it relates to Woody. I like his shades.</td>', 'Cute, nice lighting and sharp but not especially inspiring. The creases on the backdrop are interesting, though I can''t decide if they add or subtract to the overall effect. It would be nice to see one with a smooth background. Not sure what you mean by "Horsepower" as far as it relates to Woody. I like his shades.', '2006-10-29 00:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971968, 415435, 65468, '<td valign="top">Like the nostalgic feel of this image but I don''t know if I would like it better without the linen texture.</td>', 'Like the nostalgic feel of this image but I don''t know if I would like it better without the linen texture.', '2006-10-29 00:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971995, 414485, 34618, '<td valign="top">The overall softening is very cool. The running lights are exposed nicely and the shadows and/or reflections on the hood are really interesting, too. Would make a great product shot, but as far as the challenge goes it seems like the tracks are almost an afterthought as your title implies. Might be more on the challenge had you waited for a train to pass and caught it with some blurring.</td>', 'The overall softening is very cool. The running lights are exposed nicely and the shadows and/or reflections on the hood are really interesting, too. Would make a great product shot, but as far as the challenge goes it seems like the tracks are almost an afterthought as your title implies. Might be more on the challenge had you waited for a train to pass and caught it with some blurring.', '2006-10-29 00:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972010, 414769, 28471, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white conversion on this.  This photo show quite a bit detail.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the black and white conversion on this.  This photo show quite a bit detail.  Good job.', '2006-10-29 00:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
