(2972870, 415186, 34396, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.  The smoke and steam makes the train look as if it is emerging from some type of ethereal portal.  I would have liked to see just a bit more contrast.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.  The smoke and steam makes the train look as if it is emerging from some type of ethereal portal.  I would have liked to see just a bit more contrast.  Well done.', '2006-10-29 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972888, 415474, 36988, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken a very simple and perhaps obvious idea and pulled it off masterfully. Great choices in your pp approach!</td>', 'You''ve taken a very simple and perhaps obvious idea and pulled it off masterfully. Great choices in your pp approach!', '2006-10-29 12:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972890, 414213, 36988, '<td valign="top">Gratuitous pehaps but very endearing... great job!</td>', 'Gratuitous pehaps but very endearing... great job!', '2006-10-29 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972892, 414933, 34396, '<td valign="top">I think this should would have looked a bit nicer if you had moved closer to the tracks.  The tree in the foreground does not add to the composition.  If you had been a bit closer to the tracks, you could have used them as a leading line to draw the viewers eye into the photo towards the skyliine.</td>', 'I think this should would have looked a bit nicer if you had moved closer to the tracks.  The tree in the foreground does not add to the composition.  If you had been a bit closer to the tracks, you could have used them as a leading line to draw the viewers eye into the photo towards the skyliine.', '2006-10-29 12:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972895, 414422, 34396, '<td valign="top">There is a bit too much glare from the lights which also causes a couple of light halos to the right of the smokestack/tower.  I think I would have changed the POV to minimize the buildings in the background as I don''t think they add to the composition.</td>', 'There is a bit too much glare from the lights which also causes a couple of light halos to the right of the smokestack/tower.  I think I would have changed the POV to minimize the buildings in the background as I don''t think they add to the composition.', '2006-10-29 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2972973, 415525, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is good...I like the tones (duotone?) in this image, the foggy feeling and the photographic reality of this composition.</td>', 'This is good...I like the tones (duotone?) in this image, the foggy feeling and the photographic reality of this composition.', '2006-10-29 13:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
