(2972991, 415113, 42495, '<td valign="top">I got a $50 ticket trying to get a similar shot!  Good color in the background and I like the grafitti from the train.  It looks like there''s a blue tint in the rocks.</td>', 'I got a $50 ticket trying to get a similar shot!  Good color in the background and I like the grafitti from the train.  It looks like there''s a blue tint in the rocks.', '2006-10-29 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
