(2973762, 415474, 56658, '<td valign="top">similar to my origianl idea:) you need a dastardly man with a handle bar mustache. I like the tone you used. the models expression looks more like laughing than screaming but great job overall. 9</td>', 'similar to my origianl idea:) you need a dastardly man with a handle bar mustache. I like the tone you used. the models expression looks more like laughing than screaming but great job overall. 9', '2006-10-29 21:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973840, 415110, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this!  Of course, people always look at me like I''m crazy when I''m lying on the ground to take pictures of gravel and sand!  Ha Ha.  What I love about this is that it is more than just a closeup picture of a rail.  It''s leading line takes you straight to the city skyline.  The haziness of the city leads you to believe it is far far away across a blistering hot prarie.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Wow, I like this!  Of course, people always look at me like I''m crazy when I''m lying on the ground to take pictures of gravel and sand!  Ha Ha.  What I love about this is that it is more than just a closeup picture of a rail.  It''s leading line takes you straight to the city skyline.  The haziness of the city leads you to believe it is far far away across a blistering hot prarie.  Very nicely done!', '2006-10-29 21:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973842, 415651, 34396, '<td valign="top">I really like this one!  The tack-sharp focus on the crossing sign against the faint blur of the engine is genius.  I''ve seen similar shots where the blur of the train is so extreme that you can''t tell what it is.  Others where there is no blur so the train looks stationary.  This has just the right amount!  The deep blue sky adds to the shot as well.  Great photo!  Adding to my favorites.  May come back to bump this up when I get done with all of them.</td>', 'I really like this one!  The tack-sharp focus on the crossing sign against the faint blur of the engine is genius.  I''ve seen similar shots where the blur of the train is so extreme that you can''t tell what it is.  Others where there is no blur so the train looks stationary.  This has just the right amount!  The deep blue sky adds to the shot as well.  Great photo!  Adding to my favorites.  May come back to bump this up when I get done with all of them.', '2006-10-29 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973844, 414307, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  What a great looking shot of a Roundhouse.  I like the light bleeding in through the doors &amp; windows, as well as the colorful passenger car.  There is so much to look at here.  Very well done!  Adding to favorites!</td>', 'Wow!!  What a great looking shot of a Roundhouse.  I like the light bleeding in through the doors & windows, as well as the colorful passenger car.  There is so much to look at here.  Very well done!  Adding to favorites!', '2006-10-29 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973845, 415436, 34396, '<td valign="top">I really like this POV.  The floor is very cool foreground for the rest of this interesting station!  Nice Work!</td>', 'I really like this POV.  The floor is very cool foreground for the rest of this interesting station!  Nice Work!', '2006-10-29 21:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973847, 413324, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here.  Nice detail of a railroad truck.</td>', 'I like the colors here.  Nice detail of a railroad truck.', '2006-10-29 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973848, 414603, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very cool photograph! The steam filling the building with the light filtering through it really makes this shot.  Great angle as well.  Adding to favorites!</td>', 'Very cool photograph! The steam filling the building with the light filtering through it really makes this shot.  Great angle as well.  Adding to favorites!', '2006-10-29 21:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973849, 415582, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the detail on this shot.  The cropping seems a bit tight, but I don''t know that it affects the overall impact.  Even though this is "Old No. 7" I think I may need to give it an 8.</td>', 'I like the detail on this shot.  The cropping seems a bit tight, but I don''t know that it affects the overall impact.  Even though this is "Old No. 7" I think I may need to give it an 8.', '2006-10-29 21:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973851, 414676, 34396, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  It''s too bad you couldn''t have gotten directly over the coupling to remove the last bit of the train car.  Could have called this one Yin/Yang.  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this image.  It''s too bad you couldn''t have gotten directly over the coupling to remove the last bit of the train car.  Could have called this one Yin/Yang.  Well done!', '2006-10-29 21:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973853, 415327, 34396, '<td valign="top">Love these engines and you have captured it beautifully.</td>', 'Love these engines and you have captured it beautifully.', '2006-10-29 21:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973855, 415458, 34396, '<td valign="top">I love the imagery that this photo portrays.  The fall colors, the black train, the white smoke, the blaring headlight.  I can almost hear the "chuf" of the engine.  My only critique of this shot is that I think it would have had more impact if it were shot from a lower angle.  Probably not possible, without endangering yourself or your camera.  Overall, a great shot!</td>', 'I love the imagery that this photo portrays.  The fall colors, the black train, the white smoke, the blaring headlight.  I can almost hear the "chuf" of the engine.  My only critique of this shot is that I think it would have had more impact if it were shot from a lower angle.  Probably not possible, without endangering yourself or your camera.  Overall, a great shot!', '2006-10-29 21:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973856, 415243, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring of this photo.  It makes me see this as a transitional photo.  Sepiatone at the top, Black&amp;White at the bottom, and rusting away in the middle.  The days of railroads are all but gone, and this photo seems to bring out that soon they will be a faded memory.  Great job!</td>', 'I like the coloring of this photo.  It makes me see this as a transitional photo.  Sepiatone at the top, Black&White at the bottom, and rusting away in the middle.  The days of railroads are all but gone, and this photo seems to bring out that soon they will be a faded memory.  Great job!', '2006-10-29 21:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973857, 415245, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Looks like it came straight out of a train calendar.  I like the dark sky and how the colors of the engine and cars stand out.  Good work.  Adding to favorites</td>', 'I like this shot.  Looks like it came straight out of a train calendar.  I like the dark sky and how the colors of the engine and cars stand out.  Good work.  Adding to favorites', '2006-10-29 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2973859, 415453, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The bright red cabooses seen throught the falling snow looks very cool.  If I had to complain about anything it would be the green flares in the window.</td>', 'I like this photo.  The bright red cabooses seen throught the falling snow looks very cool.  If I had to complain about anything it would be the green flares in the window.', '2006-10-29 21:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
