(2974381, 414485, 62755, '<td valign="top">I never thought people would take this one so seriously... I thought I made the title obvious that I didnt care about actually placing. Thank some of you for your comments. <br/> <br/>However comments like, "the quality of this photo is horrible" followed up by "Hehe, thanks for pointing that out ;)" are just uncalled for. You dont like it? Shut up.</td>', 'I never thought people would take this one so seriously... I thought I made the title obvious that I didnt care about actually placing. Thank some of you for your comments.  However comments like, "the quality of this photo is horrible" followed up by "Hehe, thanks for pointing that out ;)" are just uncalled for. You dont like it? Shut up.', '2006-10-30 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2974383, 415533, 22734, '<td valign="top">Everything fell into place here to create this little magic show!Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Everything fell into place here to create this little magic show!Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-10-30 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2974384, 414040, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!  The angle on the roof and the dirt slope both push my eye to the tracks.  They almost leave me feeling off-balance, like I''m going to fall in front of a train.</td>', 'This is terrific!  The angle on the roof and the dirt slope both push my eye to the tracks.  They almost leave me feeling off-balance, like I''m going to fall in front of a train.', '2006-10-30 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2974385, 415582, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 777STAN:</b></div><hr/><i> I say it should be Old #9.  It would be Old #10, except that the focus is a little too complex for my taste.  ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You seem to be the only one to notice the blurred background ... good eye! : )<br/> <br/>FWIW on the print image I have tried to make the effect a little less pronounced, and added matching blurring through the windows and out the back of the cab, which I didn''t bother with for the entry.<br/> <br/>I am especially happy with (and surprised by) all the comments on the sharpness and clarity, as this was a handheld shot at an extremely slow 1/6-second shutter speed, and I have a disk full of slightly blurry train shots to show that that this was perhaps as much luck as skill.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments and my best score in a while!</td>', 'Originally posted by 777STAN: I say it should be Old #9.  It would be Old #10, except that the focus is a little too complex for my taste.  ;)  You seem to be the only one to notice the blurred background ... good eye! : ) FWIW on the print image I have tried to make the effect a little less pronounced, and added matching blurring through the windows and out the back of the cab, which I didn''t bother with for the entry. I am especially happy with (and surprised by) all the comments on the sharpness and clarity, as this was a handheld shot at an extremely slow 1/6-second shutter speed, and I have a disk full of slightly blurry train shots to show that that this was perhaps as much luck as skill. Thanks for all the comments and my best score in a while!', '2006-10-30 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2974386, 415109, 47573, '<td valign="top">congrats on your ribbon, nice to see another iowa boy doing good.</td>', 'congrats on your ribbon, nice to see another iowa boy doing good.', '2006-10-30 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2974388, 415587, 22734, '<td valign="top">You have taken artistic license with the cropping to create this charming little gem. It takes a lot of guts to go out of the box! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'You have taken artistic license with the cropping to create this charming little gem. It takes a lot of guts to go out of the box! Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-10-30 00:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
