(2974451, 414710, 56797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this shot a lot. I''m just confused by the smoke.  That makes the train seem to be moving to the right.  But the locomotive''s main body seems to be to the right.  Was it backing up? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it was sitting still.</td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413: I like this shot a lot. I''m just confused by the smoke.  That makes the train seem to be moving to the right.  But the locomotive''s main body seems to be to the right.  Was it backing up?   it was sitting still.', '2006-10-30 01:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
