(2974953, 414669, 56658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m getting really tired of these romanticized guitar men.  I don''t believe this set up for a second. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>so stop voting on them or better yet stop commenting on them. If you don''t like the photo then fine give me some sort of critique about how to improve it, not just bitch about my unrealistic setup. while it is your right to vote and comment as you see fit, telling me my subject is contrived is fairly rude and doesn''t help anyone. if everyone just took photos of whatever it is that you want then guess what that would be overdone too.</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: I''m getting really tired of these romanticized guitar men.  I don''t believe this set up for a second.   so stop voting on them or better yet stop commenting on them. If you don''t like the photo then fine give me some sort of critique about how to improve it, not just bitch about my unrealistic setup. while it is your right to vote and comment as you see fit, telling me my subject is contrived is fairly rude and doesn''t help anyone. if everyone just took photos of whatever it is that you want then guess what that would be overdone too.', '2006-10-30 07:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
