(2976553, 414213, 30982, '<td valign="top">This really should have scored higher - I think you actually did yourself in with the title.  I love the "straight down the tracks" view with the light on the rails.  I didn''t recognize this as Aidan though I suspected it might be - hard to tell when you can''t see his curls!  And you gotta quit sticking your kid on active railroad tracks... ;-)</td>', 'This really should have scored higher - I think you actually did yourself in with the title.  I love the "straight down the tracks" view with the light on the rails.  I didn''t recognize this as Aidan though I suspected it might be - hard to tell when you can''t see his curls!  And you gotta quit sticking your kid on active railroad tracks... ;-)', '2006-10-30 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2976613, 414281, 45115, '<td valign="top">should have scored into the TOP 10...</td>', 'should have scored into the TOP 10...', '2006-10-30 19:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
