(2976635, 415092, 6999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I love photos that depend so much on composition. They become almost pure photographs. 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I couldn''t (no really, I couldn''t) have put it more succinctly myself. There is something here that no other art-form (or, if that''s too loaded a phrase, then ''medium'', ''means of communication'' will serve) can do; that is ''composition'', and an only be at its highest in a photograph.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I love photos that depend so much on composition. They become almost pure photographs. 9   I couldn''t (no really, I couldn''t) have put it more succinctly myself. There is something here that no other art-form (or, if that''s too loaded a phrase, then ''medium'', ''means of communication'' will serve) can do; that is ''composition'', and an only be at its highest in a photograph.', '2006-10-30 19:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2976638, 415436, 45187, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2006-10-30 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2976641, 415109, 45187, '<td valign="top">The perspective and dramatic sky makes it for me.</td>', 'The perspective and dramatic sky makes it for me.', '2006-10-30 19:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2976646, 415458, 45187, '<td valign="top">Love this shot - the colours and that the train disappears at the point of rule of thirds makes it a great composition.  I''m not totally keen on the beaming light, but otherwise a poster of a shot!</td>', 'Love this shot - the colours and that the train disappears at the point of rule of thirds makes it a great composition.  I''m not totally keen on the beaming light, but otherwise a poster of a shot!', '2006-10-30 19:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
