(2977661, 415193, 19672, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite entries. It''s a shame it did so poorly. However, the issues in which it fails are easily resolved. The composition was nicely done.<br/> <br/>Removing the number. And also make sure you save the image at a higher quality setting as there are noticeable "compression artifacts".</td>', 'This was one of my favorite entries. It''s a shame it did so poorly. However, the issues in which it fails are easily resolved. The composition was nicely done. Removing the number. And also make sure you save the image at a higher quality setting as there are noticeable "compression artifacts".', '2006-10-31 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
