(2978846, 415436, 24486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sheryll:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s funny.  After the security guards figured it out did they leave you alone to get more shots or make you move along? BTW I think I only gave one ten this challenge and it was you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I showed the security guards the photographs that I had taken &amp; they didn''t seem to bad about it this time but I have had problems in the past here when I took photographs fot the Lucky Seven challenge. That day I was moved on by the security guards. I think their biggest worry is not terrorism but someone taking photographs for profit &amp; the owners of this station missing out on their cut. Well that was the impression I got that day.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Sheryll: That''s funny.  After the security guards figured it out did they leave you alone to get more shots or make you move along? BTW I think I only gave one ten this challenge and it was you.   I showed the security guards the photographs that I had taken & they didn''t seem to bad about it this time but I have had problems in the past here when I took photographs fot the Lucky Seven challenge. That day I was moved on by the security guards. I think their biggest worry is not terrorism but someone taking photographs for profit & the owners of this station missing out on their cut. Well that was the impression I got that day.', '2006-10-31 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
