(3039821, 414870, 68682, '<td valign="top">most people really don''t like lensflares but I really like them and  this is one of the best shots with a couple of beauties. really like it SW. very unusual... to me, it seems like the front pinker flare maybe has something to do with the internal lens structure, I''ve wondered about these alot...</td>', 'most people really don''t like lensflares but I really like them and  this is one of the best shots with a couple of beauties. really like it SW. very unusual... to me, it seems like the front pinker flare maybe has something to do with the internal lens structure, I''ve wondered about these alot...', '2006-11-17 09:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
