(5722989, 415673, 69008, '<td valign="top">There is something captivating about this shot for me.  I like the concept of the lantern marking the end of a train, and the afterglow marking the end of the day.   It''s nice that the colors of the orange almost match.   Smaller aperture, like f11 @ 1/4 sec, or f16 @ 1/2 sec would have improved focus on the trees in the BG, and made for a better challenge score.</td>', 'There is something captivating about this shot for me.  I like the concept of the lantern marking the end of a train, and the afterglow marking the end of the day.   It''s nice that the colors of the orange almost match.   Smaller aperture, like f11 @ 1/4 sec, or f16 @ 1/2 sec would have improved focus on the trees in the BG, and made for a better challenge score.', '2009-11-11 09:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723180, 415673, 48451, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Melon, for your kind comments! I understand what you are saying but this was hand held, the whole thing would have been shaken if I had tried a longer exposure! I think it did poorly in the challenge because the image doesn''t particularly say "train" to the voters. I do appreciate your input, though! Thanks! ~Sharon</td>', 'Thanks, Melon, for your kind comments! I understand what you are saying but this was hand held, the whole thing would have been shaken if I had tried a longer exposure! I think it did poorly in the challenge because the image doesn''t particularly say "train" to the voters. I do appreciate your input, though! Thanks! ~Sharon', '2009-11-11 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
